each other. It includes only individuals who interact with each other primarily at a workplace.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">For each of the functions below, please move the slider to show how much you think a <u>good<\/u> relationship of this kind between a human and an AI-powered chatbot would <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">serve that function. If you think it doesn't matter or it's neutral whether the relationship serves that function, please select \"0\" (you will have to move the slider away and back to do so).<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Now consider a good relationship between fellow workers at a company, where one of these workers...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ede057b0-7fff-1820-d47c-1534a66d3d78\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Now consider a <u>good<\/u> relationship between <strong>fellow workers at a company, <\/strong>where one of these workers is a <strong>human <\/strong>and the other is an<strong> AI-powered chatbot.&nbsp;<\/strong><\/span><\/span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Within this context, consider the best relationship that work colleagues could have with one another (in terms of a relationship of that kind).<\/span><\