.&nbsp;<\/strong><\/span><\/span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Within this context, consider the best relationship that a mental health provider and patient could have with one another (in terms of a relationship of that kind).<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">This refers to relationships in which one individual provides expert medical or therapeutic services to the other. It includes a therapist-client relationship, for example.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">For each of the functions below, please move the slider to show how much you think a <u>good<\/u> relationship of this kind would <\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">serve that function. If you think it doesn't matter or it's neutral whether the relationship serves that function, please select \"0\" (you will have to move the slider away and back to do so).<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Now consider a good relationship between a mental health provider and patient, where the mental h...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ede057b0-7fff-1820-d47c-1534a66d3d78\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Now consider a <u>good <\/u>relationship between <s