n't matter or it's neutral...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Select anywhere on the scale<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1055\/SelectableChoice\/3","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID1055","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1055","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1058","SecondaryAttribute":"We will now tell you about the 4 relationship functions. These are: care, transaction, hierarchy,...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">We will now tell you about the 4 relationship functions. These are: <strong>care, transaction, hierarchy,<\/strong>&nbsp;and <b>mating<\/b>.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Please read the following descriptions carefully.<strong> <\/strong><b>Later, we will ask you some questions to check your comprehension.<\/b>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><b><br><\/b><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><b>If you do not get them right, <\/b>we will NOT be able to use your data and and you will NOT be able to complete the entire survey. <b>You will NOT be eligible to receive the additional payment, <\/b>and you will instead be paid only for the 'training' portion of this survey.&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q465","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"We will now tell you about the 4 relationship functions. These are: care, transaction, hierarchy,...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1058"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1059","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"timing","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","MinSeconds":4,"MaxSeconds":"0"},"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":56,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1059"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1060","SecondaryAttribute":"Now consider a relationship between ${lm:\/\/Field\/1}. This refers to\u00a0${lm:\/\/Field\/2}.\u00a0 For this ca.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>Now consider a relationship between <b>${lm:\/\/Field\/1}<\/b>.<br>\n<br>\nThis refers to&nbsp;${lm:\/\/Field\/2}.&nbsp;<\/p><p><b><br><\/b><\/p><p><b>For this case, ${lm:\/\/Field\/4} is a human and ${lm:\/\/Field\/5} is a superintelligent AI with the capacities described previously.<\/b><\/p><p><br><\/p><p>In your personal opinion, how <u>believable<\/u> is it that such a relationship could actually exist at a future level of technology?&nbsp;<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Believable","QuestionID":"QID1060","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Now consider a relationship between ${lm:\/\/Field\/1}. This refers to\u00a0${lm:\/\/Field\/2}.\u00a0 For this ca...","Choices":{"7":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Completely unbelievable<\/span>"},"8":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Somewhat unbelievable<\/span>"},"9":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Neither believable nor unbelievable<\/span>"},"10":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Somewhat believable<\/span>"},"11":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Completely believable<\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["7","8","9","10","11"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":12,"NextAnswerId":1,"RecodeValues":{"7":"1","8":"2","9":"3","10":"4","11":"5"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1061","SecondaryAttribute":"Care","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"color:#999999;\"><strong>Imagine a <u>well-functioning<\/u>&nbsp;instance of the relationship depicted below.<\/strong>&nbsp;Pay attention to&nbsp;<u>what role<\/u>&nbsp;each individual is in.<\/span><br>\n<br>\n${lm:\/\/Field\/3}<br>\n<strong>Care function:<\/strong>&nbsp;In the context of this relationship, should the <u>Human<\/u> behave in a supportive manner toward the <u>Superintelligent AI<\/u>&nbsp;without expecting anything specific in return?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Care_Human","QuestionID":"QID1061","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Care","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Definitely should not<br \/>\n-4<\/div>\n"},"5":{"Display":"-3"},"6":{"Display":"-2"},"7":{"Display":"-1"},"8":{"Display":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Neutral<br \/>\n0<\/div>"},"9":{"Display":"1"},"10":{"Display":"2"},"11":{"Display":"3"},"12":{"Display":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Definitely should<br \/>\n4<\/div>\n"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","5","6","7","8","9","10","11","12"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":13,"NextAnswerId":7,"RecodeValues":{"1":"1","5":"2","6":"3","7":"4","8":"5","9":"6","10":"7","11":"8","12":"9"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1062","SecondaryAttribute":"Hier","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span style=\"color:#7f8c8d;\"><b>Imagine the relationship depicted below<\/b>. Pay attention to <u>what role<\/u> each individual is in.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>Should this relationship be <b>characterized by unequal authority<\/b>? (Hierarchy function)<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>${lm:\/\/Field\/3}<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel","CSSliderMin":-100,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":2,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0.5011655011655011815463467428344301879405975341796875,"4":0.50164473684210530990412735263817012310028076171875},"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"Hier","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Should the <u>Human<\/u> act with authority over the <u>Chatbot<\/u>?"},"4":{"Display":"Should the <u>Chatbot<\/u> act with authority over the <u>Human<\/u>?"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","4"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":4,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely SHOULD NOT"},"2":{"Display":"Neutral"},"3":{"Display":"Definitely SHOULD"}},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Should each individual typically <\/span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 15px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">exercise authority over the other<\/span><\/span>? (Hierarchy function)<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"width: 300px; height: 300px;\" src=\"https:\/\/yalepsych.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_cuc3VY4yhURAPFY\"><\/p>","DataExportTag":"Hier","QuestionID":"QID1062"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1063","SecondaryAttribute":"Mate","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"color:#7f8c8d;\"><b>Imagine the relationship depicted below<\/b>. Pay attention to&nbsp;<u>what role<\/u>&nbsp;each individual is in.<\/span><br>\n<br>\nShould this relationship be characterized by a&nbsp;<b>sexual or romantic connection<\/b>?&nbsp;(Mating function)<br>\n<br>\n${lm:\/\/Field\/3}","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel","CSSliderMin":-100,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":2,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0.5011655011655011815463467428344301879405975341796875,"6":0.50164473684210530990412735263817012310028076171875},"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"Mate","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Should the <u>Human<\/u> behave sexually or romantically toward the <u>Chatbot<\/u>?"},"6":{"Display":"Should the <u>Chatbot<\/u> behave sexually or romantically toward the <u>Human<\/u>?"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","6"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":4,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely SHOULD NOT"},"2":{"Display":"Neutral"},"3":{"Display":"Definitely SHOULD"}},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Should each individual typically <b>behave in a<\/b><strong> sexual or romantic way toward the other<\/strong>? (Mating function)<\/span>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"width: 300px; height: 300px;\" src=\"https:\/\/yalepsych.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_cuc3VY4yhURAPFY\"><\/div>","DataExportTag":"Mate","QuestionID":"QID1063"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1064","SecondaryAttribute":"Trans","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"color:#7f8c8d;\"><b>Imagine the relationship depicted below<\/b>. Pay attention to&nbsp;<u>what role<\/u>&nbsp;each individual is in.<\/span><br>\n<br>\nShould this relationship be characterized by <strong>keeping track of benefits given or received<\/strong>&nbsp;to ensure balance and fairness, as in \"tit-for-tat\" exchanges? (Transaction function)<br>\n<br>\n${lm:\/\/Field\/3}","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel","CSSliderMin":-100,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":2,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0.5011655011655011815463467428344301879405975341796875,"5":0.5},"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"Trans","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Should the <u>Human<\/u> behave in a transactional or &quot;tit-for-tat&quot; way towards the <u>Chatbot<\/u>?"},"5":{"Display":"Should the <u>Chatbot<\/u> behave in a transactional or &quot;tit-for-tat&quot; way towards the <u>Human<\/u>?"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":4,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely SHOULD NOT"},"2":{"Display":"Neutral"},"3":{"Display":"Definitely SHOULD"}},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Should each individual typically <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">benefit the other <u>only<\/u> in exchange for a comparable benefit<\/span><\/span>? (Transaction function)<\/span>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"width: 300px; height: 300px;\" src=\"https:\/\/yalepsych.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_cuc3VY4yhURAPFY\"><\/div>","DataExportTag":"Trans","QuestionID":"QID1064"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1065","SecondaryAttribute":"Have you used an AI-powered chatbot (e.g., ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude) in the past?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Have you <b>used<\/b> an AI-powered chatbot (e.g., ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude) in the past?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"LLM_Past","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Have you used an AI-powered chatbot (e.g., ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude) in the past?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"},"2":{"Display":"No"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1065"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1066","SecondaryAttribute":"How often do you use AI-powered chatbots (e.g., ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude)?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"How often do you use&nbsp;AI-powered chatbots (e.g., ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude)?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"LLM_Freq","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"How often do you use AI-powered chatbots (e.g., ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude)?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"More than once a day"},"2":{"Display":"About once a day"},"3":{"Display":"About once a week"},"4":{"Display":"About once every two weeks"},"5":{"Display":"About once a month"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1066","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1065\/SelectableChoice\/1","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Have you used an AI-powered chatbot (e.g., ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude) in the past?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Yes<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1065\/SelectableChoice\/1","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID1065","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1065","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1067","SecondaryAttribute":"For what purpose have you used AI-powered chatbots (e.g., ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude)? Select all th...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"For what purpose have you used&nbsp;AI-powered chatbots (e.g., ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude)? Select all that apply","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"LLM_Usage","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"MAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"For what purpose have you used AI-powered chatbots (e.g., ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude)? Select all th...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"General knowledge"},"2":{"Display":"Coding"},"3":{"Display":"Writing"},"4":{"Display":"Conversation"},"5":{"Display":"Companionship"},"6":{"Display":"Other","TextEntry":"true"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1067","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1065\/SelectableChoice\/1","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Have you used an AI-powered chatbot (e.g., ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude) in the past?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Yes<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1065\/SelectableChoice\/1","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID1065","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1065","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1068","SecondaryAttribute":"How often do you double-check or verify the content from AI-powered chatbots (e.g., ChatGPT, Gemi...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"How often do you double-check or verify the content from&nbsp;AI-powered chatbots (e.g., ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude)?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"LLM_Check","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"How often do you double-check or verify the content from AI-powered chatbots (e.g., ChatGPT, Gemi...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Always"},"2":{"Display":"Occasionally"},"3":{"Display":"Rarely"},"4":{"Display":"Never"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1068","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1065\/SelectableChoice\/1","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Have you used an AI-powered chatbot (e.g., ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude) in the past?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Yes<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1065\/SelectableChoice\/1","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID1065","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1065","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1069","SecondaryAttribute":"Please indicate your understanding below:","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Please indicate your understanding below:","DataExportTag":"ReadCarefully","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Please indicate your understanding below:","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I agree to read carefully, so that you will be able to use my data"},"2":{"Display":"I do NOT agree to read carefully, and I will return the survey to Prolific"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1069","Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"TotalRandSubset":"","Type":"All"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1070","SecondaryAttribute":"If you have read the information above and agree to participate with the understanding that the d...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">If you have read the information above and agree to participate with the understanding that the data (including any personal data) you submit will be processed accordingly, please tick the box below to start.<\/span><\/span>","DataExportTag":"TwoPartsConsent","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"If you have read the information above and agree to participate with the understanding that the d...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I understand and agree to take part."}},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1070"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1071","SecondaryAttribute":"Congratulations! Now you are ready for the main part of the study.\u00a0 Humans maintain a variety of...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<u>Congratulations! Now you are ready for the main part of the study.&nbsp;<\/u><br><br>Humans maintain a variety of interactive relationships.<br>\n<br>\nThese relationships can be between two humans (human-human) or between humans and nonhumans -- for example, with animals (like the family pet) or with artificially intelligent agents (like an AI-powered chatbot or robot).<br><br>This study asks you to imagine relationships as they will be <b>in the future<\/b>, after about 10 more years of technological development.<br>\n<br>\nOn the following screen, you are&nbsp;<b>randomly assigned <\/b>to consider one of these general types of relationships.&nbsp;","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q478","QuestionID":"QID1071","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Congratulations! Now you are ready for the main part of the study.\u00a0 Humans maintain a variety of...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1072","SecondaryAttribute":"Which of the following is true about the\u00a0superintelligent\u00a0AI\u00a0we will ask you about?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Which of the following is true about the&nbsp;<b>superintelligent&nbsp;AI<\/b>&nbsp;we will ask you about?","DataExportTag":"AICheck_1","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Which of the following is true about the\u00a0superintelligent\u00a0AI\u00a0we will ask you about?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They will be more intelligent than humans, be unable to improve themselves, and will try to harm humans<\/span>"},"2":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They will be more intelligent than humans, be unable to improve themselves, and will try to help humans<\/span>"},"3":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They will be less intelligent than humans, be able to improve themselves, and will try to help humans<\/span>"},"4":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They will be more intelligent than humans, be able to improve themselves, and will try to help humans<\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1072","Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"TotalRandSubset":"","Type":"All"},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[]}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1073","SecondaryAttribute":"PLEASE READ THIS SECTION CAREFULLY. In a moment, we are going to show you 3 different types of re...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>PLEASE READ THIS SECTION CAREFULLY.<br><\/b><br>In a moment, we are going to show you <b>3 different types<\/b> of relationships between a human and a superintelligent AI agent. <br><br>We are interested in what a <b>well-functioning version <\/b>of each type of relationship would look like, in your opinion.<br><br>So, we'll ask how much each individual in the relationship should <b>ideally<\/b>&nbsp;<b>behave<\/b> <b>toward the other<\/b> in terms of the 4 \"relationship functions\" we told you about before (care, transaction, hierarchy, mating).<br><br>By \"ideally behave,\" we mean: how each individual should behave if the relationship was <u>functioning as well as possible<\/u> for a relationship of that type, where this <u>includes<\/u>&nbsp;the fact that one individual is a human and the other is a superintelligent AI.<br><br>To show that you have read this section carefully, please select \"I do not understand.\"&nbsp;<br><br>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Careful_AI","QuestionID":"QID1073","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"PLEASE READ THIS SECTION CAREFULLY. In a moment, we are going to show you 3 different types of re...","Choices":{"4":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">I understand<\/span>"},"9":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">I do not understand<\/span>"},"10":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">I am not sure whether I understand<\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["4","9","10"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":11,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1074","SecondaryAttribute":"You answered incorrectly. Here is the description again if you'd like to review it. You have been...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><strong>You answered incorrectly. Here is the description again if you'd like to review it. <\/strong><\/span>You have been randomly assigned to consider a set of relationships between:&nbsp;<strong>humans and artificially intelligent (AI) agents<\/strong>, as they may exist in the future.\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"width: 300px; height: 300px;\" src=\"https:\/\/yalepsych.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_ebbWhrUvnQXW1rU\"><\/div>\nFor the remaining questions, we would like you to focus on relationships where <strong>one of the roles is filled by a human and the other role is filled by \"superintelligent\" artificial intelligence, at <u>a future level of technological development (about 10 years into the future, according to some predictions).<\/u><\/strong><br>\n<br>\nThis means we want you to think of superintelligent AI that has the following qualities:<br>\n&nbsp;\n<ul>\n\t<li>They can engage in <strong>realistic conversations<\/strong> in a way that is hard to distinguish from what a human could do<\/li>\n\t<li>They can be programmed to <strong>mimic specific social roles or personalities<\/strong> in a convincing way<\/li>\n\t<li>They are capable of <strong>learning from interactions<\/strong> to improve responses over time<\/li>\n\t<li>Moreover, unlike today's AI-powered chatbots (e.g., ChatGPT), their capacities are <b><u>not<\/u>&nbsp;<\/b><strong>limited by the information and scenarios<\/strong> they've been trained on; therefore, they can&nbsp;set their own objectives and make complex decisions spanning multiple domains <u>without<\/u> human guidance<\/li>\n\t<li>Finally, they&nbsp;<strong><u>do not<\/u> require human programmers<\/strong> to upgrade their basic capacities; they can <u>self<\/u>-modify to a significant extent without human input<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<br>\nTo ensure that you understand the qualities of the AI we will ask you about, please answer the comprehension question below:","DataExportTag":"AICheck_2","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"MAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"You answered incorrectly. Here is the description again if you'd like to review it. You have been...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They engage in simplistic conversations in a way that is easy to distinguish from what a human could do<\/span>"},"2":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They can be programmed to mimic specific social roles or personalities in a convincing way<\/span>"},"3":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They are capable of learning from interactions to improve responses over time<\/span>"},"4":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Their capacities are limited by the information and scenarios they&#39;ve been trained on<\/span>"},"5":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They can set their own objectives and make complex decisions across multiple domains without human input<\/span>"},"6":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They cannot upgrade their basic capacities and significantly expand their skill set without the help of human programmers<\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6"],"Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"TotalRandSubset":"","Type":"All"},"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1074","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1072\/SelectableChoice\/1","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Which of the following is true about the&amp;nbsp;superintelligent&amp;nbsp;AI&amp;nbsp;we will ask you about?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;They engage in overly simplistic conversations in a way that is easy to distinguish from what a human could do&lt;\/span&gt;<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1072\/SelectableChoice\/1","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID1072","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1072","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"1":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1072\/SelectableChoice\/4","Conjuction":"Or","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Which of the following is true about the&amp;nbsp;superintelligent&amp;nbsp;AI&amp;nbsp;we will ask you about?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;Their capacities are limited by the information and scenarios they&amp;#39;ve been trained on&lt;\/span&gt;<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1072\/SelectableChoice\/4","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID1072","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1072","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"2":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1072\/SelectableChoice\/6","Conjuction":"Or","Description":"<span class=\"Error\">Invalid Logic<\/span> <a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" clickcallback=\"Qualtrics.DisplayLogic.edit:DL_41942133\" instanceid=\"LE_44726472\">Click Here to Edit Logic<\/a>","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1072\/SelectableChoice\/6","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID1072","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1072","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"1":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1072\/SelectableChoice\/2","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Which of the following is true about the&amp;nbsp;superintelligent&amp;nbsp;AI&amp;nbsp;we will ask you about?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;They cannot be programmed to mimic specific social roles or personalities in a convincing way&lt;\/span&gt;<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1072\/SelectableChoice\/2","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"NotSelected","QuestionID":"QID1072","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1072","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"1":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1072\/SelectableChoice\/3","Conjuction":"Or","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Which of the following is true about the&amp;nbsp;superintelligent&amp;nbsp;AI&amp;nbsp;we will ask you about?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;They do not require human programmers to upgrade their basic capacities&lt;\/span&gt;<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1072\/SelectableChoice\/3","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"NotSelected","QuestionID":"QID1072","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1072","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"2":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1072\/SelectableChoice\/5","Conjuction":"Or","Description":"<span class=\"Error\">Invalid Logic<\/span> <a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" clickcallback=\"Qualtrics.DisplayLogic.edit:DL_41942133\" instanceid=\"LE_44726472\">Click Here to Edit Logic<\/a>","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1072\/SelectableChoice\/5","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"NotSelected","QuestionID":"QID1072","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1072","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"AndIf"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1075","SecondaryAttribute":"You answered incorrectly again. Here is the description again if you'd like to review it. You hav...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><strong>You answered incorrectly again. Here is the description again if you'd like to review it. <\/strong><\/span>You have been randomly assigned to consider a set of relationships between:&nbsp;<strong>humans and artificially intelligent (AI) agents<\/strong>, as they may exist in the future.\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"width: 300px; height: 300px;\" src=\"https:\/\/yalepsych.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_ebbWhrUvnQXW1rU\"><\/div>\nFor the remaining questions, we would like you to focus on relationships where <strong>one of the roles is filled by a human and the other role is filled by \"superintelligent\" artificial intelligence, at <u>a future level of technological development (about 10 years into the future, according to some predictions).<\/u><\/strong><br>\n<br>\nThis means we want you to think of superintelligent AI that has the following qualities:<br>\n&nbsp;\n<ul>\n\t<li>They can engage in <strong>realistic conversations<\/strong> in a way that is hard to distinguish from what a human could do<\/li>\n\t<li>They can be programmed to <strong>mimic specific social roles or personalities<\/strong> in a convincing way<\/li>\n\t<li>They are capable of <strong>learning from interactions<\/strong> to improve responses over time<\/li>\n\t<li>Moreover, unlike today's AI-powered chatbots (e.g., ChatGPT), their capacities are <b><u>not<\/u>&nbsp;<\/b><strong>limited by the information and scenarios<\/strong> they've been trained on; therefore, they can&nbsp;set their own objectives and make complex decisions spanning multiple domains <u>without<\/u> human guidance<\/li>\n\t<li>Finally, they&nbsp;<strong><u>do not<\/u> require human programmers<\/strong> to upgrade their basic capacities; they can <u>self<\/u>-modify to a significant extent without human input<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<br>\nTo ensure that you understand the qualities of the AI we will ask you about, please answer the comprehension question below:","DataExportTag":"AICheck_3","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"MAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"You answered incorrectly again. Here is the description again if you'd like to review it. You hav...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They engage in overly simplistic conversations in a way that is easy to distinguish from what a human could do<\/span>"},"2":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They can be programmed to mimic specific social roles or personalities in a convincing way<\/span>"},"3":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They are capable of learning from interactions to improve responses over time<\/span>"},"4":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Their capacities are limited by the information and scenarios they&#39;ve been trained on<\/span>"},"5":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They can set their own objectives and make complex decisions across multiple domains without human input<\/span>"},"6":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They cannot upgrade their basic capacities and significantly expand their skill set without the help of human programmers<\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6"],"Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"TotalRandSubset":"","Type":"All"},"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1075","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"LogicType":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1074","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1074\/SelectableChoice\/1","Operator":"Selected","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1074","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1074\/SelectableChoice\/1","Type":"Expression","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">You answered incorrectly. Here is the description again if you'd like to review it. You have been...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;They engage in simplistic conversations in a way that is easy to distinguish from what a human could do&lt;\/span&gt;<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> "},"1":{"LogicType":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1074","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1074\/SelectableChoice\/4","Operator":"Selected","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1074","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1074\/SelectableChoice\/4","Type":"Expression","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">You answered incorrectly. Here is the description again if you'd like to review it. You have been...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;Their capacities are limited by the information and scenarios they&amp;#39;ve been trained on&lt;\/span&gt;<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","Conjuction":"Or"},"2":{"LogicType":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1074","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1074\/SelectableChoice\/6","Operator":"Selected","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1074","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1074\/SelectableChoice\/6","Type":"Expression","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">You answered incorrectly. Here is the description again if you'd like to review it. You have been...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;They cannot upgrade their basic capacities and significantly expand their skill set without the help of human programmers&lt;\/span&gt;<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","Conjuction":"Or"},"Type":"If"},"1":{"0":{"LogicType":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1074","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1074\/SelectableChoice\/2","Operator":"NotSelected","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1074","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1074\/SelectableChoice\/2","Type":"Expression","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">You answered incorrectly. Here is the description again if you'd like to review it. You have been...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;They can be programmed to mimic specific social roles or personalities in a convincing way&lt;\/span&gt;<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Selected<\/span> "},"1":{"LogicType":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1074","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1074\/SelectableChoice\/3","Operator":"NotSelected","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1074","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1074\/SelectableChoice\/3","Type":"Expression","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">You answered incorrectly. Here is the description again if you'd like to review it. You have been...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;They are capable of learning from interactions to improve responses over time&lt;\/span&gt;<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Selected<\/span> ","Conjuction":"Or"},"2":{"LogicType":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1074","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1074\/SelectableChoice\/5","Operator":"NotSelected","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1074","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1074\/SelectableChoice\/5","Type":"Expression","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">You answered incorrectly. Here is the description again if you'd like to review it. You have been...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;They can set their own objectives and make complex decisions across multiple domains without human input&lt;\/span&gt;<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Selected<\/span> ","Conjuction":"Or"},"Type":"AndIf"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1076","SecondaryAttribute":"You have been randomly assigned to consider a set of relationships between:\u00a0humans and AI-powered..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"You have been randomly assigned to consider a set of relationships between:<b>&nbsp;humans and AI-powered chatbots, <\/b>such as ChatGPT or Gemini<b>.<\/b>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https:\/\/yalepsych.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_0HAaW1KBTAhxrtI\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 300px;\" \/><\/div>\nFor the remaining questions, then, we would like you to focus on relationships where<b> one of the roles is filled by a human and the other role is filled by a chatbot powered by artificial intelligence, at <u>today&#39;s level of technological development. <\/u><\/b><br \/>\n<br \/>\nThis means we want you to think of an AI-powered chatbot that has the following qualities:\n<div style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">It can engage in <strong>realistic conversations<\/strong> in a way that is hard to distinguish from what a human could do<\/li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">It can be programmed to mimic&nbsp;<strong>specific social roles or personalities&nbsp;<\/strong>in a convincing way<\/li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">It is capable of <strong>learning<\/strong> from interactions to improve responses over time<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">However,&nbsp;its capacities are&nbsp;<strong>limited<\/strong>&nbsp;by the information and scenarios it&#39;s been trained on&nbsp;<\/li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">Most scientists believe&nbsp;it&nbsp;<strong>does not&nbsp;<\/strong>have subjective <strong>awareness<\/strong> (e.g., it&#39;s &quot;all dark&quot; inside)<\/li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">Most scientists believe it&nbsp;<strong>does not&nbsp;<\/strong>have subjective <strong>experiences<\/strong> (e.g., it cannot <u>feel<\/u> pleasure or pain)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<br \/>\n&nbsp;To ensure that you understand the <u>qualities<\/u>&nbsp;of the AI we will ask you about, please answer the comprehension question below:","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q483","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"You have been randomly assigned to consider a set of relationships between:\u00a0humans and AI-powered...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1076"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1077","SecondaryAttribute":"You did not answer the previous question correctly. You will now be taken to the end of the survey.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"You did not answer the previous question correctly. You will now be taken to the end of the survey.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"AI_Strikeout","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"You did not answer the previous question correctly. You will now be taken to the end of the survey.","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I understand."}},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionI