lement":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1078","SecondaryAttribute":"We are going to tell you about four different relationship functions. These are: care, transactio...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"We are going to tell you about four different relationship functions. <br><br>These are: <b>care, transaction, hierarchy, and mating.<\/b>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q485","QuestionID":"QID1078","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"We are going to tell you about four different relationship functions. These are: care, transactio...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1079","SecondaryAttribute":"Click to write the question text","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Click to write the question text","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q486","QuestionID":"QID1079","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Click to write the question text","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1080","SecondaryAttribute":"Click to write the question text","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<img style=\"width: 300px; height: 300px;\" src=\"https:\/\/yalepsych.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_0pUdrb5wMt2pOES\">Click to write the question text","DataExportTag":"Q487","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Click to write the question text","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 1"},"2":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 2"},"3":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 3"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1080"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1081","SecondaryAttribute":"Consider a relationship between ${lm:\/\/Field\/1}. This refers to\u00a0${lm:\/\/Field\/2}. For this case, $..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>Consider a relationship between <b>${lm:\/\/Field\/1}<\/b>.<br>\n<br>\nThis refers to&nbsp;${lm:\/\/Field\/2}. <b>For this case, ${lm:\/\/Field\/4} is a human and ${lm:\/\/Field\/5} is an AI-powered chatbot.<\/b><\/p><p><b><br><\/b><\/p><p>${lm:\/\/Field\/3}<br><\/p><p><b><br><\/b><\/p><p>At today's level of technology, do you think this kind of relationship \u2014 between a human and an AI-powered chatbot \u2014 is believable?&nbsp;<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"believability","QuestionID":"QID1081","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Consider a relationship between ${lm:\/\/Field\/1}. This refers to\u00a0${lm:\/\/Field\/2}. For this case, $...","Choices":{"4":{"Display":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Definitely NOT believable<br \/>\n-4<\/div>"},"5":{"Display":"-3"},"6":{"Display":"-2"},"7":{"Display":"-1"},"8":{"Display":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Neither believable nor unbelievable<br \/>\n0<\/div>"},"9":{"Display":"1"},"10":{"Display":"2"},"11":{"Display":"3"},"12":{"Display":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Definitely believable<br \/>\n4<\/div>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["4","5","6","7","8","9","10","11","12"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType