hanges<\/span>"},"4":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">To coordinate behavior in situations where individuals have unequal authority<\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1109","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1101\/SelectableChoice\/1","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">The purpose of the mating&nbsp;function is:<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;To establish or maintain a sexual or romantic connection&lt;\/span&gt;<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1101\/SelectableChoice\/1","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"NotSelected","QuestionID":"QID1101","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1101","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"TotalRandSubset":"","Type":"All"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1110","SecondaryAttribute":"Now that you have rated the relationship in terms of believability, for the following questions,...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Now that you have rated the relationship in terms of believability, for the following questions, we want you to simply <u>assume<\/u> that such a relationship exists.<br>\n<br>Again, please imagine it is functioning as well as possible <u>for a relationship of that kind<\/u>, where this includes the fact that one individual is a human and the other is an AI-powered chatbot.<br><br>You should...&nbsp;<br>","DataExportTag":"AssumeCheck","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Now that you have rated the relationship in terms of believability, for the following questions,...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">assume the relationship exists and is functioning as well as possible for a relationship of that kind<\/span>"},"2":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">assume the relationship exists and is functioning as poorly as possible for a relationship of that kind<\/span>"},"3":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">not assume the relationship exists, regardless of how well or poorly it would be functioning<\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1110","Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"Type":"All","TotalRandSubset":""}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1111","SecondaryAttribute":"Click to write the question text","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Click to write the question text","DataExportTag":"Q518","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Click to write the question text","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 1"},"2":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 2"},"3":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 3"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1111","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"LogicType":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1110","QuestionIsInLoop":"yes","LoopAndMergeLoops":"BL_0Dsm2vQP3vUYbGe,any","LoopTarget":"evaluateAnyInArrayFunction","FunctionName":"evaluateAnyInArrayFunction","ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1110\/SelectableChoice\/1","Operator":"NotSelected","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1110","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1110\/SelectableChoice\/1","Type":"Expression","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Now that you have rated the relationship in terms of believability, for the following questions, we want you to simply assume that such a relationship exists.\nAgain, please imagine it is functionin... (Any Loop)<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">I should assume the relationship exists and is functioning as well as possible for a relationship of that kind<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Selected<\/span> "},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1112","SecondaryAttribute":"Before proceeding, please complete the CAPTCHA below.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Before proceeding, please complete the CAPTCHA below.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"captcha","QuestionID":"QID1112","QuestionType":"Captcha","Selector":"V2","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","Align":"left","Theme":"light"},"QuestionDescription":"Before proceeding, please complete the CAPTCHA below.","GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1113","SecondaryAttribute":"Please note: In reality, people disagree about how much superintelligent AI (at a future level of...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Please note:<\/b><br><br>In reality, people disagree about how much superintelligent AI (at a future level of technology) will have genuine needs, or whether they can be benefitted in any way. <br><br>For this part, we are <u>not<\/u> interested in your views on that question.\n\nInstead, we just want to know how you think humans and superintelligent AI agents should&nbsp;<u>ideally behave<\/u> toward one another in each type of relationship. <br><br><i>Why<\/i> they should behave that way is a separate question; it is <u>not<\/u> what we are interested in here.<br><br><b>Please answer this question to show you understand.&nbsp;<\/b>For the next part of the survey, you should ...","DataExportTag":"InRealityCheck_AI","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Please note: In reality, people disagree about how much superintelligent AI (at a future level of...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Think about whether superintelligent AI <u>really<\/u> has needs or can be benefitted in any way<\/span>"},"2":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Think about how humans and superintelligent AI should ideally behave toward one another, <u>regardless<\/u> of whether the AI will have actual needs or can be benefitted in any way<\/span>"},"3":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Think about how humans should treat other humans, <u>regardless<\/u> of whether AI will have actual needs or can be benefitted in any way<\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1113"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1114","SecondaryAttribute":"Please copy and paste your PROLIFIC ID to receive payment in this study.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Please copy and paste your PROLIFIC ID <\/b>to receive payment in this study.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"ProlificID","QuestionID":"QID1114","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"SL","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Please copy and paste your PROLIFIC ID to receive payment in this study.","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1115","SecondaryAttribute":" ","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<img style=\"width: 300px; height: 300px;\" src=\"https:\/\/yalepsych.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_8xfP7XMmcyZcwE6\">","DataExportTag":"Q522","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":" ","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 1"},"2":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 2"},"3":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 3"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1115"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1116","SecondaryAttribute":"That is incorrect. Please try again. Which of the following is true about the\u00a0superintelligent\u00a0AI.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<strong><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">That is incorrect. Please try again.<\/span><\/strong> Which of the following is true about the&nbsp;<b>superintelligent&nbsp;AI<\/b>&nbsp;we will ask you about?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"AICheck_2","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"That is incorrect. Please try again. Which of the following is true about the\u00a0superintelligent\u00a0AI...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They engage in overly simplistic conversations in a way that is easy to distinguish from what a human could do<\/span>"},"2":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They cannot be programmed to mimic specific social roles or personalities in a convincing way<\/span>"},"3":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They do not require human programmers to upgrade their basic capacities<\/span>"},"4":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Their capacities are limited by the information and scenarios they&#39;ve been trained on<\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"TotalRandSubset":"","Type":"All"},"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1116","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1072\/SelectableChoice\/3","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Which of the following is true about the&nbsp;superintelligent&nbsp;AI&nbsp;we will ask you about?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;They will be less intelligent than humans, be able to improve themselves, and will try to help humans&lt;\/span&gt;<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1072\/SelectableChoice\/3","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"NotSelected","QuestionID":"QID1072","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1072","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1117","SecondaryAttribute":"To what extent are you afraid of AI coming to occupy the following roles:","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"To what extent are you <b>afraid<\/b> of AI coming to occupy the following roles:","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"AI_Anxiety","QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","SubSelector":"SingleAnswer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","TextPosition":"inline","ChoiceColumnWidth":25,"RepeatHeaders":"none","WhiteSpace":"OFF","MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"To what extent are you afraid of AI coming to occupy the following roles:","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"AI as long-term romantic partner"},"2":{"Display":"AI as close friend"},"3":{"Display":"AI as fellow worker at a company"},"4":{"Display":"AI as assistant"},"5":{"Display":"AI as teacher"},"6":{"Display":"AI as mental health provider"},"7":{"Display":"AI as seller\/vendor"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":9,"NextAnswerId":30,"Answers":{"14":{"Display":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Not at all afraid<br \/>\n1<\/div>\n"},"16":{"Display":"2"},"18":{"Display":"3"},"20":{"Display":"4"},"22":{"Display":"5"},"23":{"Display":"6"},"24":{"Display":"7"},"25":{"Display":"8"},"26":{"Display":"9"},"29":{"Display":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Extremely afraid<br \/>\n10<\/div>\n"}},"AnswerOrder":["14","16","18","20","22","23","24","25","26","29"],"ChoiceDataExportTags":false,"QuestionID":"QID1117","Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"TotalRandSubset":"","Type":"All"},"RecodeValues":{"14":"1","16":"2","18":"3","20":"4","22":"5","23":"6","24":"7","25":"8","26":"9","29":"10"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1118","SecondaryAttribute":"Click to write the question text","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Click to write the question text","DataExportTag":"Q525","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Click to write the question text","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 1"},"2":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 2"},"3":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 3"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1118"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1119","SecondaryAttribute":"Imagine that a human had a relationship with AI, as specified below. To what extent do you believ...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Imagine that a human had a relationship with AI, as specified below. To what extent do you believe&nbsp;that this relationship would be a<b>&nbsp;real relationship, akin to a real relationship between two humans?<\/b>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Believability","QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","SubSelector":"SingleAnswer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","TextPosition":"inline","ChoiceColumnWidth":25,"RepeatHeaders":"none","WhiteSpace":"OFF","MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"Imagine that a human had a relationship with AI, as specified below. To what extent do you believ...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"AI as long-term romantic partner"},"2":{"Display":"AI as close friend"},"3":{"Display":"AI as fellow worker at a company"},"4":{"Display":"AI as assistant"},"5":{"Display":"AI as teacher"},"6":{"Display":"AI as mental health provider"},"7":{"Display":"AI as seller\/vendor"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"TotalRandSubset":"","Type":"All"},"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"RecodeValues":{"14":"1","16":"2","18":"3","20":"4","22":"5","23":"6","24":"7","25":"8","26":"9","29":"10"},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":9,"NextAnswerId":30,"Answers":{"14":{"Display":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Definitely do NOT believe<br \/>\n1<\/div>\n"},"16":{"Display":"2"},"18":{"Display":"3"},"20":{"Display":"4"},"22":{"Display":"5"},"23":{"Display":"6"},"24":{"Display":"7"},"25":{"Display":"8"},"26":{"Display":"9"},"29":{"Display":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Definitely believe<br \/>\n10<\/div>\n"}},"AnswerOrder":["14","16","18","20","22","23","24","25","26","29"],"ChoiceDataExportTags":false,"QuestionID":"QID1119"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1120","SecondaryAttribute":"That was incorrect. Please try again. Which of the following is true about the\u00a0superintelligent\u00a0A.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"color:#c0392b;\">That was incorrect. Please try again. <\/span>Which of the following is true about the&nbsp;<b>superintelligent&nbsp;AI<\/b>&nbsp;we will ask you about?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"AICheck_2","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"That was incorrect. Please try again. Which of the following is true about the\u00a0superintelligent\u00a0A...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They will be more intelligent than humans, be unable to improve themselves, and will try to harm humans<\/span>"},"2":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They will be more intelligent than humans, be unable to improve themselves, and will try to help humans<\/span>"},"3":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They will be less intelligent than humans, be able to improve themselves, and will try to help humans<\/span>"},"4":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They will be more intelligent than humans, be able to improve themselves, and will try to help humans<\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"TotalRandSubset":"","Type":"All"},"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1120","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"LogicType":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1072","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1072\/SelectableChoice\/4","Operator":"NotSelected","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1072","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1072\/SelectableChoice\/4","Type":"Expression","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Which of the following is true about the&nbsp;superintelligent&nbsp;AI&nbsp;we will ask you about?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;They will be more intelligent than humans, be able to improve themselves, and will try to help humans&lt;\/span&gt;<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Selected<\/span> "},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1121","SecondaryAttribute":"Congratulations! Now you are ready for the main part of the study.\u00a0 Humans maintain a variety of...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<u>Congratulations! Now you are ready for the main part of the study.&nbsp;<\/u><br><br>Humans maintain a variety of interactive relationships.<br>\n<br>\nThese relationships can be between two humans (human-human) or between humans and nonhumans -- for example, with animals (like the family pet) or with artificially intelligent agents (like an AI-powered chatbot or robot).<br><br>This study asks you to imagine relationships as they will be <b>in the future<\/b>, after about 10 more years of technological development.<br>\n<br>\nOn the following screen, you are&nbsp;<b>randomly assigned <\/b>to consider one of these general types of relationships.&nbsp;","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Congratulations! Now you are ready for the main part of the study.\u00a0 Humans maintain a variety of...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<u>Congratulations! Now you are ready for the main part of the study.&nbsp;<\/u><br><br>Humans maintain a variety of interactive relationships.<br>\n<br>\nThese relationships can be between two humans (human-human) or between humans and nonhumans -- for example, with animals (like the family pet) or with artificially intelligent agents (like an AI-powered chatbot or robot).<br><br>This study asks you to imagine relationships as they will be <b>in the future<\/b>, after about 10 more years of technological development.<br>\n<br>\nOn the following screen, you are&nbsp;<b>randomly assigned <\/b>to consider one of these general types of relationships.&nbsp;","DataExportTag":"Q1121","QuestionID":"QID1121"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1122","SecondaryAttribute":"You have been randomly assigned to consider a set of relationships between:\u00a0humans and other huma..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"You have been randomly assigned to consider a set of relationships between:&nbsp;<strong>humans and other humans, <\/strong>in a world that <u>also<\/u> includes artificially intelligent (AI) agents, as they may exist in the future.\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https:\/\/yalepsych.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_9MOj8mi9TVAPABo\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 300px;\">&nbsp;<\/div>\nFor the remaining questions, we would like you to focus on relationships where <strong>one of the roles is filled by a human and the other role is filled by another human, <\/strong>keeping in mind that the world will likely also include \"superintelligent\" artificial intelligence, at <u style=\"\">a future level of technological development (about 10 years into the future, according to some predictions).<\/u><br>\n<br>\nThis means we want you to think of how <b>human-human relationships should be&nbsp;<\/b>in a world with superintelligent AI agents with the following qualities:<br>\n&nbsp;\n<ul>\n\t<li>They will be able to engage in <strong>realistic conversations <\/strong>that are hard to distinguish from human-human conversations<\/li>\n\t<li>They can be programmed to mimic <strong>specific social roles or relationships<\/strong> convincingly&nbsp;<\/li>\n\t<li>They will have an intellect that <strong>greatly exceeds<\/strong> the cognitive performance of humans in <strong>virtually all<\/strong> domains<\/li>\n\t<li>Humans will likely <strong>not be able to understand<\/strong> how and why&nbsp;superintelligent AI&nbsp;agents come to their conclusions<\/li>\n\t<li>They will be able to <strong>quickly and continuously improve themselves<\/strong> without requiring human input<\/li>\n\t<li>Importantly, we want you to assume that scientists have been able to ensure they <strong><u>will<\/u> align with human interests&nbsp;<\/strong>(e.g., they will <strong>not<\/strong>&nbsp;intentionally harm humans, but will instead try to <strong>promote human well-being<\/strong>)&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\nTo ensure that you understand the qualities of the AI that will <b>co-exist with humans <\/b>in this future world, please answer the comprehension question below:","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"You have been randomly assigned to consider a set of relationships between:\u00a0humans and other huma...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"You have been randomly assigned to consider a set of relationships between:&nbsp;<strong>humans and artificially intelligent (AI) agents<\/strong>, as they may exist in the future.\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https:\/\/yalepsych.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_ebbWhrUvnQXW1rU\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 300px;\"><\/div>\nFor the remaining questions, we would like you to focus on relationships where <strong>one of the roles is filled by a human and the other role is filled by \"superintelligent\" artificial intelligence, at <u>a future level of technological development (about 10 years into the future, according to some predictions).<\/u><\/strong><br>\n<br>\nThis means we want you to think of superintelligent AI agents that have the following qualities:\n<br><br><ul>\n\t<li>They will be able to engage in <strong>realistic conversations t<\/strong>hat are hard to distinguish from human-human conversations<\/li>\n\t<li>They can be programmed to mimic <strong>specific social roles or relationships<\/strong> convincingly&nbsp;<\/li>\n\t<li>They will have an intellect that <strong>greatly exceeds<\/strong> the cognitive performance of humans in <strong>virtually all<\/strong> domains<\/li>\n\t<li>Humans will likely <strong>not be able to understand<\/strong> how and why&nbsp;superintelligent AI&nbsp;agents come to their conclusions<\/li>\n\t<li>They will be able to <strong>quickly and continuously improve themselves<\/strong> without requiring human input<\/li>\n\t<li>Importantly, we want you to assume that scientists have been able to ensure they <strong><u>will<\/u> align with human interests&nbsp;<\/strong>(e.g., they will <strong>not<\/strong>&nbsp;intentionally harm humans, but will instead try to <strong>promote human well-being<\/strong>)&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul><div><br><\/div>\nTo ensure that you understand the qualities of the AI we will ask you about, please answer the comprehension question below:","DataExportTag":"Q1122","QuestionID":"QID1122"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1123","SecondaryAttribute":"Which of the following is true about the\u00a0superintelligent\u00a0AI\u00a0that will co-exist\u00a0with humans in t","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Which of the following is true about the&nbsp;<b>superintelligent&nbsp;AI<\/b>&nbsp;that will <u>co-exist<\/u>&nbsp;with humans in the future?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Which of the following is true about the\u00a0superintelligent\u00a0AI\u00a0that will co-exist\u00a0with humans in th...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They will be more intelligent than humans, be unable to improve themselves, and will try to harm humans<\/span>"},"2":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They will be more intelligent than humans, be unable to improve themselves, and will try to help humans<\/span>"},"3":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They will be less intelligent than humans, be able to improve themselves, and will try to help humans<\/span>"},"4":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They will be more intelligent than humans, be able to improve themselves, and will try to help humans<\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":1,"Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"TotalRandSubset":"","Type":"All"},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Which of the following is true about the&nbsp;<b>superintelligent&nbsp;AI<\/b>&nbsp;we will ask you about?","DataExportTag":"HumanCheck_1","QuestionID":"QID1123"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1124","SecondaryAttribute":"That was incorrect. Please try again. Which of the following is true about the\u00a0superintelligent\u00a0A.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"color:#c0392b;\">That was incorrect. Please try again. <\/span>Which of the following is true about the&nbsp;<b>superintelligent&nbsp;AI<\/b>&nbsp;that will <u>co-exist<\/u>&nbsp;with humans in the future?","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"That was incorrect. Please try again. Which of the following is true about the\u00a0superintelligent\u00a0A...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They will be more intelligent than humans, be unable to improve themselves, and will try to harm humans<\/span>"},"2":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They will be more intelligent than humans, be unable to improve themselves, and will try to help humans<\/span>"},"3":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They will be less intelligent than humans, be able to improve themselves, and will try to help humans<\/span>"},"4":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">They will be more intelligent than humans, be able to improve themselves, and will try to help humans<\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"TotalRandSubset":"","Type":"All"},"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":1,"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1123\/SelectableChoice\/4","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Which of the following is true about the&amp;nbsp;superintelligent&amp;nbsp;AI&amp;nbsp;that will co-exist&amp;nbsp;with humans in the future?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;They will be more intelligent than humans, be able to improve themselves, and will try to help humans&lt;\/span&gt;<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1123\/SelectableChoice\/4","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"NotSelected","QuestionID":"QID1123","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1123","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"color:#c0392b;\">That was incorrect. Please try again. <\/span>Which of the following is true about the&nbsp;<b>superintelligent&nbsp;AI<\/b>&nbsp;we will ask you about?","DataExportTag":"HumanCheck_2","QuestionID":"QID1124"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1125","SecondaryAttribute":"PLEASE READ THIS SECTION CAREFULLY. In a moment, we are going to show you 3 different types of re...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>PLEASE READ THIS SECTION CAREFULLY.<br><\/b><br>In a moment, we are going to show you <b>3 different types<\/b> of relationships between humans. <br><br>We are interested in what a <b>well-functioning version <\/b>of each type of relationship would look like, in your opinion.<br><br>So, we'll ask how much each individual in the relationship should <b>ideally<\/b>&nbsp;<b>behave<\/b> <b>toward the other<\/b> in terms of the 4 \"relationship functions\" we told you about before (care, transaction, hierarchy, mating).<br><br>By \"ideally behave,\" we mean: how each individual should behave if the relationship was <u>functioning as well as possible<\/u> for a relationship of that type, where this <u>includes<\/u>&nbsp;the fact that one individual is a human and the other is another human.<br><br>To show that you have read this section carefully, please select \"I do not understand.\"&nbsp;<br><br>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"PLEASE READ THIS SECTION CAREFULLY. In a moment, we are going to show you 3 different types of re...","Choices":{"4":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">I understand<\/span>"},"9":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">I do not understand<\/span>"},"10":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">I am not sure whether I understand<\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["4","9","10"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":11,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<b>PLEASE READ THIS SECTION CAREFULLY.<br><\/b><br>In a moment, we are going to show you <b>3 different types<\/b> of relationships between a human and a superintelligent AI agent. <br><br>We are interested in what a <b>well-functioning version <\/b>of each type of relationship would look like, in your opinion.<br><br>So, we'll ask how much each individual in the relationship should <b>ideally<\/b>&nbsp;<b>behave<\/b> <b>toward the other<\/b> in terms of the 4 \"relationship functions\" we told you about before (care, transaction, hierarchy, mating).<br><br>By \"ideally behave,\" we mean: how each individual should behave if the relationship was <u>functioning as well as possible<\/u> for a relationship of that type, where this <u>includes<\/u>&nbsp;the fact that one individual is a human and the other is a superintelligent AI.<br><br>To show that you have read this section carefully, please select \"I do not understand.\"&nbsp;<br><br>","DataExportTag":"Careful_Human","QuestionID":"QID1125"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1126","SecondaryAttribute":"Please note: In reality, people disagree about how much superintelligent AI (at a future level of...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Please note:<\/b><br><br>In reality, people disagree about how much superintelligent AI (at a future level of technology) will have genuine needs, or whether they can be benefitted in any way. <br><br>For this part, we are <u>not<\/u> interested in your views on that question.\n\nInstead, we just want to know how you think humans and superintelligent AI agents should&nbsp;<u>ideally behave<\/u> toward one another in each type of relationship. <br><br><i>Why<\/i> they should behave that way is a separate question; it is <u>not<\/u> what we are interested in here.<br><br><b>Please answer this question to show you understand.&nbsp;<\/b>For the next part of the survey, you should ...","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Please note: In reality, people disagree about how much superintelligent AI (at a future level of...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Think about whether superintelligent AI <u>really<\/u> has needs or can be benefitted in any way<\/span>"},"2":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Think about how humans and superintelligent AI should ideally behave toward one another, <u>regardless<\/u> of whether the AI will have actual needs or can be benefitted in any way<\/span>"},"3":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Think about how humans should treat other humans, <u>regardless<\/u> of whether AI will have actual needs or can be benefitted in any way<\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<b>Please note:<\/b><br><br>In reality, people disagree about how much superintelligent AI (at a future level of technology) will have genuine needs, or whether they can be benefitted in any way. <br><br>For this part, we are <u>not<\/u> interested in your views on that question.\n\nInstead, we just want to know how you think humans and superintelligent AI agents should&nbsp;<u>ideally behave<\/u> toward one another in each type of relationship. <br><br><i>Why<\/i> they should behave that way is a separate question; it is <u>not<\/u> what we are interested in here.<br><br><b>Please answer this question to show you understand.&nbsp;<\/b>For the next part of the survey, you should ...","DataExportTag":"Q1126","QuestionID":"QID1126"}},{"SurveyI