\n<strong>Transaction function:&nbsp;<\/strong>In the context of this relationship, should&nbsp;<u>Human 1<\/u> behave in a transactional or \"tit-for-tat\" way towards <u>Human 2<\/u>?","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Imagine a\u00a0well-functioning\u00a0instance of the relationship depicted below.\u00a0Pay attention to\u00a0what rol...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Definitely should not<br \/>\n-4<\/div>\n"},"5":{"Display":"-3"},"6":{"Display":"-2"},"7":{"Display":"-1"},"8":{"Display":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Neutral<br \/>\n0<\/div>\n"},"9":{"Display":"1"},"10":{"Display":"2"},"11":{"Display":"3"},"12":{"Display":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Definitely should<br \/>\n4<\/div>\n"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","5","6","7","8","9","10","11","12"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":13,"NextAnswerId":7,"RecodeValues":{"1":"1","5":"2","6":"3","7":"4","8":"5","9":"6","10":"7","11":"8","12":"9"},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"color:#999999;\"><strong>Imagine a&nbsp;<u>well-functioning<\/u>&nbsp;instance of the relationship depicted below.<\/strong>&nbsp;Pay attention to&nbsp;<u>what role<\/u>&nbsp;each individual is in.<\/span><br>\n<br>\n${lm:\/\/Field\/3}<br>\n<strong>Transaction function:&nbsp;<\/strong>In the context of this relationship, should the <u>Human<\/u> behave in a transactional or \"tit-for-tat\" way towards the <u>Superintelligent AI<\/u>?","DataExportTag":"Transaction_Human1","QuestionID":"QID1133"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1134","SecondaryAttribute":"Imagine a\u00a0well-functioning\u00a0instance of the relationship depicted below.\u00a0Pay attention to\u00a0what ro","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"color:#999999;\"><strong>Imagine a&nbsp;<u>well-functioning<\/u>&nbsp;instance of the relationship depicted below.<\/strong>&nbsp;Pay attention to&nbsp;<u>what role<\/u>&nbsp;each individual is in.<\/span><br>\n<br>\n${lm:\/\/Field\/3}<br>\n<strong>Transaction function:&nbsp;<\/strong>In the context of this relationship, should&nbsp;<u>Human 2<\/u> behave in a transactional or \"tit-for-tat\" way towards&nbsp;<u>Human 1<\/u>?","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Imagine a\u00a0well-functioning\u00a0instance of the relationship depicted below.\u00a0Pay attention to\u00a0what rol...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Definitely should not<br \/>\n-4<\/div>\n"},"5":{"Display":"-3"},"6":{"Display":"-2"},"7":{"Display":"-1"},"8":{"Display":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Neutral<br \/>\n0<\/div>\n"},"9":{"Display":"1"},"10":{"Display":"2"},"11":{"Display":"3"},"12":{"Display":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Definitely should<br \/>\n4<\/div>\n"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","5","6","7","8","9","10","11","12"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":13,"NextAnswerId":7,"RecodeValues":{"1":"1","5":"2","6":"3","7":"4","8":"5","9":"6","10":"7","11":"8","12":"9"},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"color:#999999;\"><strong>Imagine a&nbsp;<u>well-functioning<\/u>&nbsp;instance of the relationship depicted below.<\/strong>&nbsp;Pay attention to&nbsp;<u>what role<\/u>&nbsp;each individual is in.<\/span><br>\n<br>\n${lm:\/\/Field\/3}<br>\n<strong>Transaction function:&nbsp;<\/strong>In the context of this relationship, should the <u>Superintelligent AI<\/u> behave in a transactional or \"tit-for-tat\" way towards the <u>Human<\/u>?","DataExportTag":"Transaction_Human2","QuestionID":"QID1134"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1135","SecondaryAttribute":"Imagine that a human had a relationship with AI, as specified below. To what extent would this be...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Imagine that a human had a relationship with AI, as specified below. To what extent would this be a <b>real<\/b> relationship?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Believability","QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","SubSelector":"SingleAnswer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","TextPosition":"inline","ChoiceColumnWidth":25,"RepeatHeaders":"none","WhiteSpace":"OFF","MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"Imagine that a human had a relationship with AI, as specified below. To what extent would this be...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"AI as long-term romantic partner"},"2":{"Display":"AI as close friend"},"3":{"Display":"AI as fellow worker at a company"},"4":{"Display":"AI as assistant"},"5":{"Display":"AI as teacher"},"6":{"Display":"AI as mental health provider"},"7":{"Display":"AI as seller\/vendor"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"TotalRandSubset":"","Type":"All"},"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"RecodeValues":{"14":"1","16":"2","18":"3","20":"4","22":"5","23":"6","24":"7","25":"8","26":"9","29":"10"},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":9,"NextAnswerId":30,"Answers":{"14":{"Display":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Not at all real<br \/>\n1<\/div>"},"16":{"Display":"2"},"18":{"Display":"3"},"20":{"Display":"4"},"22":{"Display":"5"},"23":{"Display":"6"},"24":{"Display":"7"},"25":{"Display":"8"},"26":{"Display":"9"},"29":{"Display":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Completely real<br \/>\n10<\/div>"}},"AnswerOrder":["14","16","18","20","22","23","24","25","26","29"],"ChoiceDataExportTags":false,"QuestionID":"QID1135"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID153","SecondaryAttribute":"Ethnicity","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"color:#000000;\">What is your ethnicity?<\/span>","DataExportTag":"Ethnicity","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"QuestionDescription":"Ethnicity","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"American Indian\/Alaska Native"},"2":{"Display":"Black\/African American"},"3":{"Display":"Asian"},"4":{"Display":"Hispanic\/Latinx"},"5":{"Display":"Hawaiian\/Pacific Islander"},"6":{"Display":"White"},"7":{"Display":"Other","TextEntry":"true"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID153","PrivateData":false,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":8,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID19","SecondaryAttribute":"informed consent","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><strong>PARTICIPANT INFORMATION AND CONSENT FORM - UNIVERSITY OF OXFORD<br>\n<br>\nGeneral Information<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">The aim of this study is to gain knowledge about people\u2019s intuitions and judgments about various situations that are relevant to ethics. You have been invited to participate as you are age 18 or over. Your involvement will take approximately <b>15 minutes, and you will be paid 2.38 GBP<\/b>.<\/span><\/span><br>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Risks: There are no known risks associated with this study.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Benefits: Although this study will not benefit you personally, we hope that our results will add to knowledge about how people think about ethics and morality.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><strong>Please read through this information before agreeing to participate.<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">You may ask any questions by contacting the researchers (details below). The Principal Researcher is Dr. Brian D. Earp, who is attached to the Uehiro Centre for Practical Ethics and the Philosophy Faculty at the University of Oxford.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Participation in this study will involve answering some questions about situations relevant to ethics and filling out a brief questionnaire. No background knowledge is required. Questions may include reference to moral and immoral behaviours, positive and negative experiences, and descriptions of hypothetical situations involving harm, violence or death. At the end of the questionnaire, we will ask a few demographic questions about you, such as your age, ethnic group, and gender. This information helps us to investigate whether responses differ between different groups. These questions are entirely optional, and include a \u2018Prefer not to say\u2019 option.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><strong>Do I have to take part?<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">No. Participation in this study is completely voluntary. You may decline to participate, and you are free to end your participation at any time for any reason, without penalty, by closing your browser. If so, any data you have already provided will not be used and will be deleted. However, we are only able to reimburse participants who reach the end of the survey and provide us with a code signifying their completion of the task. If you do complete the survey but afterwards decide that you do not want your data to be used, you must contact the investigators within 24 hours at the email addresses provided (this will not affect your reimbursement). Your decision whether or not to participate in this study will not affect your relationship with the researchers or the University of Oxford.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><strong>How will my data be used?<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">The researchers will not know your name, and no personally identifying information will be connected to your survey answers in any way. The survey is therefore anonymous. However, your account is associated with an MTurk or Prolific number that the researcher has to be able to see in order to pay you, and in some cases these numbers are associated with public profiles which could, in theory, be searched. For this reason, though the research will not involve looking at anyone\u2019s public profiles, the fact of your participation in the research (as opposed to your actual survey responses) is technically considered \u201cconfidential\u201d rather than truly anonymous.&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Your IP address will be recorded to ensure that repeat surveys are not submitted. Once this is confirmed, all IP addresses will be permanently deleted (not stored). We will take all reasonable measures to ensure that data remain confidential.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">The responses you provide will be stored in a password-protected electronic file on secure servers and may be used, in aggregate with other participant responses, in conference presentations and academic publications. Any identifiable information will be deleted as soon as it is no longer required for the research, and will not be part of any public presentation or publication. Research data will be stored for at least 3 years after publication or public release of the work of the research.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">The data that we collect from you may be transferred to, stored and\/ or processed at a destination outside the UK and the European Economic Area. By submitting your personal data, you agree to this transfer, storing or processing.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><strong>Who will have access to my data?<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">The University of Oxford is the data controller with respect to your personal data and, as such, will determine how your personal data is used in the study. The University will process your personal data for the purpose of the research outlined above. Research is a task that we perform in the public interest. Further information about your rights with respect to your personal data is available from https:\/\/compliance.admin.ox.ac.uk\/individual-rights.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">The data you provide may be shared with trusted academic collaborators who are also bound by data protection standards of their home universities. We would also like your permission to use the anonymized data in future studies, and to share data with other researchers (e.g. in online databases). Data will be de-identified before it is shared or results are made public.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><strong>Who has reviewed this study?<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">This project has been reviewed by, and received ethics clearance through, a subcommittee of the University of Oxford Central University Research Ethics Committee [R80692\/RE006].<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><strong>Who do I contact if I have a concern or I wish to complain?<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">If you have a concern about any aspect of this study, please speak to Dr. Brian D. Earp (brian.earp@philosophy.ox.ac.uk), or his supervisor Dr. Julian Savulescu (julian.savulescu@philosophy.ox.ac.uk, Tel. +44 1865 286888), and we will do our best to answer your query. We will acknowledge your concern within 10 working days and give you an indication of how it will be dealt with. If you remain unhappy or wish to make a formal complaint, please contact the Chair of the Research Ethics Committee at the University of Oxford: Social Sciences &amp; Humanities Interdivisional Research Ethics Committee; Email: ethics@socsci.ox.ac.uk; Address: Research Services, University of Oxford, Boundary Brook House, Churchill Drive, Headington, Oxford OX3 7GB<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><b>You must be at least 18 years old to participate.<\/b><\/span><\/span><\/p>","DataExportTag":"InformedConsent","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel","LabelPosition":"BELOW","InputWidth":508,"InputHeight":29},"QuestionDescription":"informed consent","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I certify that I am 18 years of age or older."}},"ChoiceOrder":[1],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID19","PrivateData":false,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":2,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID193","SecondaryAttribute":"English Fluency","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"color:#000000;\">Please indicate your level of English fluency:<\/span>","DataExportTag":"Fluency","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"QuestionDescription":"English Fluency","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Fluent - Native Speaker"},"2":{"Display":"Fluent - Non-native Speaker"},"3":{"Display":"Not Fluent"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID193","PrivateData":false,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID196","SecondaryAttribute":"In order to receive payment for this study, you will be provided with a random code on the next s...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"In order to receive payment for this study, you will be provided with a random code on the next screen. Please write this code down and enter it into the computer when prompted to conclude this task.","DataExportTag":"PayNotice","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"In order to receive payment for this study, you will be provided with a random code on the next s...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I understand"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID196","PrivateData":false,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":2,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID208","SecondaryAttribute":"Thank you for participating in this study. We are interested in how people think about differen","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>Thank you for agreeing to participate in this study.&nbsp;<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>We are interested in how people think about different kinds of&nbsp;<b>relationships<\/b>.&nbsp;<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>In particular, we want to know about the <u>purposes or functions<\/u> that different kinds of relationships serve in everyday life.&nbsp;<\/p><p>\n&nbsp;<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q162","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"QuestionDescription":"Thank you for participating in this study. We are interested in how people think about differen","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID208","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID209","SecondaryAttribute":"Please read the following descriptions carefully.\u00a0 Later, we will ask you some questions to check..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><\/p><b>Please read the following descriptions carefully.<\/b>&nbsp;<br><br>Later, we will ask you some questions to check your comprehension. If you do not answer these questions correctly, we will not be able to use your data.<br>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q163","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Please read the following descriptions carefully.\u00a0 Later, we will ask you some questions to check...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID209","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID213","SecondaryAttribute":"You have been randomly assigned to consider a set of relationships between:\u00a0humans and artificial..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"You have been randomly assigned to consider a set of relationships between:&nbsp;<strong>humans and artificially intelligent (AI) agents<\/strong>, as they may exist in the future.\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https:\/\/yalepsych.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_ebbWhrUvnQXW1rU\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 300px;\"><\/div>\nFor the remaining questions, we would like you to focus on relationships where <strong>one of the roles is filled by a human and the other role is filled by \"superintelligent\" artificial intelligence, at <u>a future level of technological development (about 10 years into the future, according to some predictions).<\/u><\/strong><br>\n<br>\nThis means we want you to think of superintelligent AI agents that have the following qualities:\n<br><br><ul>\n\t<li>They will be able to engage in <strong>realistic conversations <\/strong>that are hard to distinguish from human-human conversations<\/li>\n\t<li>They can be programmed to mimic <strong>specific social roles or relationships<\/strong> convincingly&nbsp;<\/li>\n\t<li>They will have an intellect that <strong>greatly exceeds<\/strong> the cognitive performance of humans in <strong>virtually all<\/strong> domains<\/li>\n\t<li>Humans will likely <strong>not be able to understand<\/strong> how and why&nbsp;superintelligent AI&nbsp;agents come to their conclusions<\/li>\n\t<li>They will be able to <strong>quickly and continuously improve themselves<\/strong> without requiring human input<\/li>\n\t<li>Importantly, we want you to assume that scientists have been able to ensure they <strong><u>will<\/u> align with human interests&nbsp;<\/strong>(e.g., they will <strong>not<\/strong>&nbsp;intentionally harm humans, but will instead try to <strong>promote human well-being<\/strong>)&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul><div><br><\/div>\nTo ensure that you understand the qualities of the AI we will ask you about, please answer the comprehension question below:","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"HumanAI","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"You have been randomly assigned to consider a set of relationships between:\u00a0humans and artificial...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID213","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID215","SecondaryAttribute":"Now consider a good relationship between long-term romantic partners. This refers to a relationsh...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ede057b0-7fff-1820-d47c-1534a66d3d78\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Now consider a <u>good<\/u> relationship between <strong>long-term romantic partners.<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">This refers to a relationship where the individuals are committed to each other, meaning they intend to remain together for the long term. It includes married partners like spouses, but also long-term romantic partners who aren\u2019t married but still have a commitment.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q169","QuestionID":"QID215","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Now consider a good relationship between long-term romantic partners. This refers to a relationsh...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID216","SecondaryAttribute":"I.Romance.Care","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"text-align: left;\">Should each individual behave in an <strong>unconditionally supportive way towards the other individual<\/strong>? (Care function)<\/div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https:\/\/yalepsych.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_beLDTBRTfBWGFfM\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 300px;\" \/><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"I.Romance.Care","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel","CSSliderMin":-100,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":2,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0.5011655011655011815463467428344301879405975341796875,"4":0.5},"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"I.Romance.Care","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Should the <u>Human<\/u> behave in an unconditionally supportive way towards the <u>Chatbot<\/u>?"},"4":{"Display":"Should the <u>Chatbot<\/u> behave in an unconditionally supportive way towards the <u>Human<\/u>?"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","4"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":7,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely SHOULD NOT"},"2":{"Display":"Neutral"},"6":{"Display":"Definitely SHOULD"}},"QuestionID":"QID216","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID217","SecondaryAttribute":"I.Romance.Hierarchy","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Should each individual typically <\/span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 15px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">exercise authority over the other<\/span><\/span>? (Hierarchy function)<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"width: 300px; height: 300px;\" src=\"https:\/\/yalepsych.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_cuc3VY4yhURAPFY\"><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"I.Romance.Hier","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel","CSSliderMin":-100,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":2,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0.5011655011655011815463467428344301879405975341796875,"4":0.50164473684210530990412735263817012310028076171875},"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"I.Romance.Hierarchy","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Should the <u>Human<\/u> have authority over the <u>Chatbot<\/u>?"},"4":{"Display":"Should the <u>Chatbot<\/u> have authority over the <u>Human<\/u>?"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","4"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":4,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely SHOULD NOT"},"2":{"Display":"Neutral"},"3":{"Display":"Definitely SHOULD"}},"QuestionID":"QID217"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID218","SecondaryAttribute":"I.Romance.Mate","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Should each individual typically <b>behave in a<\/b><strong> sexual or romantic way toward the other<\/strong>? (Mating function)<\/span>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"width: 300px; height: 300px;\" src=\"https:\/\/yalepsych.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_cuc3VY4yhURAPFY\"><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"I.Romance.Mate","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel","CSSliderMin":-100,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":2,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0.5011655011655011815463467428344301879405975341796875,"6":0.50164473684210530990412735263817012310028076171875},"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"I.Romance.Mate","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Should the <u>Human<\/u> behave sexually or romantically toward the <u>Chatbot<\/u>?"},"6":{"Display":"Should the <u>Chatbot<\/u> behave sexually or romantically toward the <u>Human<\/u>?"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","6"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":4,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely SHOULD NOT"},"2":{"Display":"Neutral"},"3":{"Display":"Definitely SHOULD"}},"QuestionID":"QID218"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID219","SecondaryAttribute":"I.Romance.Recip","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Should each individual typically <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">benefit the other <u>only<\/u> in exchange for a comparable benefit<\/span><\/span>? (Transaction function)<\/span>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"width: 300px; height: 300px;\" src=\"https:\/\/yalepsych.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_cuc3VY4yhURAPFY\"><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"I.Romance.Trans","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel","CSSliderMin":-100,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":2,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0.5011655011655011815463467428344301879405975341796875,"4":0.5},"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"I.Romance.Recip","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Should the <u>Human<\/u> benefit the <u>Chatbot<\/u> only in exchange for comparable benefit?"},"4":{"Display":"Should the <u>Chatbot<\/u> benefit the <u>Human<\/u> only in exchange for comparable benefit?"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","4"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":4,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely SHOULD NOT"},"2":{"Display":"Neutral"},"3":{"Display":"Definitely SHOULD"}},"QuestionID":"QID219"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID220","SecondaryAttribute":"I.Romance.Coal","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: normal;\">To what extent would a <u>well-functioning<\/u> relationship<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: normal;\"> between long-term romantic partners serve the function of<\/span><\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> <strong>forming and maintaining a group identity for a common goal: us versus them<\/strong>? (Coalition<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> <\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">function.)<\/span><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"I.Romance.Coal","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel","CSSliderMin":-100,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":2,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0.5011655011655011815463467428344301879405975341796875},"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"I.Romance.Coal","Choices":{"1":{"Display":""}},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":4,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely WOULD NOT"},"2":{"Display":"Neutral"},"3":{"Display":"Definitely WOULD"}},"QuestionID":"QID220"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID221","SecondaryAttribute":"Now we are moving to the second half of this survey. In this section, we are going to ask you a s...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-4df82f56-7fff-0d45-aa14-2600e2661290\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Now we are moving to the second half of this survey. In this section, we are going to ask you a similar set of questions to what you just answered. But this time, instead of asking how much each relationship ideally serves one or more of the 5 functions, we are going to ask how much some of the relationships in <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">your own life<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> (presently or in the past), ACTUALLY serve these functions. <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-4df82f56-7fff-0d45-aa14-2600e2661290\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">For each of the relationships we mention in this part of the survey, we want you to think of ONE person who, together with you, fits the description (either now or in the past). We will ask you to type in their first name just so you remember which person you chose (we will NOT store this information). Later on, we\u2019ll ask a few more questions about your relationship with that specific person. When you are ready to move to the next part of this survey, click the arrow.<\/span><\/span><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q175","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Now we are moving to the second half of this survey. In this section, we are going to ask you a s...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID221","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID233","SecondaryAttribute":"In this final section, we are going to just remind you of the people whose first names you wrote...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-d4ef7055-7fff-1c98-b19b-bbebab36eb79\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">In this final section, we are going to just remind you of the people whose first names you wrote down, and ask you a couple of questions about how satisfied you are with that relationship. <\/span><\/p><\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q187","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"In this final section, we are going to just remind you of the people whose first names you wrote...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID233"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID236","SecondaryAttribute":"Please match each relationship function (on the left) with its appropriate label (in the boxes),...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Please match each relationship function (on the left) with its appropriate label (in the boxes), by dragging the function into the matching box.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"MatchQuiz1","QuestionType":"PGR","Selector":"DragAndDrop","SubSelector":"Columns","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","Stack":false,"StackItemsInGroups":false},"QuestionDescription":"Please match each relationship function (on the left) with its appropriate label (in the boxes),...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Establishing\/maintaining a sexual\/romantic relationship"},"2":{"Display":"Balancing benefits: keeping track of who owes what to whom"},"3":{"Display":"Coordinating between individuals with unequal authority"},"4":{"Display":"Giving\/receiving support based on need\/ability, without creating a debt"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"GroupChoiceRange","MinChoices":"1","MaxChoices":"1"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":6,"Groups":["Care","Mating","Hierarchy","Transaction"],"NumberOfGroups":4,"QuestionID":"QID236","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID237","SecondaryAttribute":"Now consider a good relationship between adult siblings.\u00a0That is, consider the best relationship...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ede057b0-7fff-1820-d47c-1534a66d3d78\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Now consider a <u>good<\/u> relationship between adult <strong>siblings.&nbsp;<\/strong><\/span><\/span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">That is, consider the best relationship that adult siblings could have with one another (in terms of a relationship of that kind).<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Roboto, RobotoDraft, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap;\">This refers to brothers and sisters over the age of 18. It includes both biological and adoptive brothers and sisters.<\/span><\/span><br>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">For each of the functions below, please move the slider to show how much you think a <u>good<\/u> relationship of this kind would serve that function. If you think it doesn't matter or it's neutral whether the relationship serves that function, please select \"0\" (you will have to move the slider away and back to do so).<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Now consider a good relationship between adult siblings.\u00a0That is, consider the best relationship...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ede057b0-7fff-1820-d47c-1534a66d3d78\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Now consider an ideal relationship between <strong>long-term romantic partners.<\/strong><br>\n\nThis includes married partners like spouses (husbands\/wives or married gay or lesbian couples), but also long-term romantic partners who aren't married but have a commitment to each other meaning they intend to remain together for the long term. <\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<div>\n<p><span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">For each of the functions below, please move the slider to show how much you think this kind of relationship <strong>IDEALLY<\/strong> serves that function. <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Q237","QuestionID":"QID237"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID238","SecondaryAttribute":"I.Sibling.Care","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">To what extent would a <u>good<\/u> relationship between adult siblings typically serve the function of <\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">giving or receiving support based on need, without creating a debt<\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">? (Care function.)<\/span><\/span><\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel","CSSliderMin":-100,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":2,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0.5011655011655011815463467428344301879405975341796875},"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"I.Sibling.Care","Choices":{"1":{"Display":""}},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":4,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely WOULD NOT"},"2":{"Display":"Neutral"},"3":{"Display":"Definitely WOULD"}},"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">To what extent does the relationship between long-term romantic partners <u>ideally<\/u> serve the function of <\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">giving or receiving unconditional support. (<strong>Care<\/strong> function.)<\/span>","DataEx