font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong> <\/strong><strong>a<\/strong><strong> parent and child. <\/strong><\/span><\/span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">That is, consider the best possible relationship that a parent and child could have with one another (in terms of a relationship of that kind).<\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">This refers to parents and their non-adult (meaning under age 18) children specifically. It includes both biological and adoptive parents\/children.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<div>\n<p><span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">For each of the functions below, please move the slider to show how much you think this kind of relationship <strong>IDEALLY<\/strong> serves that function. <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Now consider an ideal relationship between a parent and child. That is, consider the best possibl...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ede057b0-7fff-1820-d47c-1534a66d3d78\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Now consider an ideal relationship between <strong>long-term romantic partners.<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br>\n<br>\n<sp