ionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Now consider a good relationship between a supervisor and an assistant. \u00a0 This refers to any work...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ede057b0-7fff-1820-d47c-1534a66d3d78\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Now consider an ideal relationship between <strong>work colleagues or classmates.&nbsp;<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><br><\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-1285594b-7fff-7e96-8d93-6399d420a8cf\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">This refers to people who interact with each other on a regular basis at work\/school or in work\/school related activities. It includes <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">only<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> people who are on the same career or schooling l