 <\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">function.)<\/span><\/div>","DataExportTag":"I.Boss.Coal","QuestionID":"QID272"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID273","SecondaryAttribute":"Now consider a good relationship between a teacher and student. \u00a0 This refers to relationships in..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ede057b0-7fff-1820-d47c-1534a66d3d78\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Now consider a <u>good<\/u> relationship between <strong>a teacher and student<\/strong><\/span><\/span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-5c24fcec-7fff-24e2-bd4b-4c059a6611e6\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">This refers to relationships in which someone with more knowledge guides someone with less knowledge, such as in school, sports or other extracurricular activity. It includes mentor-student or coach-player relationships, for example.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Now consider a good relationship between a teacher and student. \u00a0 This refers to relationships in...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ede057b0-7fff-1820-d47c-1534a66d3d78\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Now consider an ideal relationship between <strong>a boss and an employee.&nbsp;<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><br><\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">This refers to any workplace relationship in which one person directly supervises the other and has some decision making control over the other's activities and outcomes. It includes only people who interact with each other in person at least some of the time. <\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br><\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>\n<p><span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">For each of the functions below, please move the slider to show how much you think this kind of relationship <strong>IDEALLY<\/strong> serves that function. <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Q273","QuestionID":"QID273"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID274","SecondaryAttribute":"I.Teacher.Care","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Pa