ont-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: normal;\">To what extent does the relationship between a boss and an employee <u>ideally<\/u> serve the function of<\/span><\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> forming and maintaining a group identity to meet the needs of the group as a whole. (<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Coalition <\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">function.)<\/span><\/div>","DataExportTag":"I.Teacher.Coal","QuestionID":"QID278"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID279","SecondaryAttribute":"Now consider a good relationship between extended family members.\u00a0That is, consider the best rela..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ede057b0-7fff-1820-d47c-1534a66d3d78\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Now consider a <u>good<\/u> relationship between<strong> extended family members.&nbsp;<\/strong><\/span><\/span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">That is, consider the best relationship that extended family members could have with one another (in terms of a relationship of that kind).<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-af9c8fc5-7fff-a56b-0a5d-0204dd69169e\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">This refers to relationships with relatives who are not in the immediate family (so, not parents or siblings). It includes relationships with a cousin, aunt, uncle, grandfather or grandmother. &nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">For each of the functions below, please move the slider to show how much you think a <u>good<\/u> relationship of this kind would <\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">serve that function. If you think it doesn&#39;t matter or it&#39;s neutral whether the relationship serves that function, please select &quot;0&quot; (you will have to move the slider away and back to do so).<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Now consider a good relationship between extended family members.\u00a0That is, consider the best rela...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ede057b0-7fff-1820-d47c-1534a66d3d78\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Now consider an ideal relationship between<strong> doctor and a patient.&nbsp;<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><br><\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">This refers to relationships in which one person provides expert medical or therapeutic services to the other person.&nbsp;&nbsp;It includes a medical doctor-patient relationship or a therapist-client relationship, for example.&nbsp;<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br><\/span><\/p>\n\n<div>\n<p><span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">For each of the functions below, please move the slider to show how much you think this kind of relationship <strong>IDEALLY<\/strong> serves that function. <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Q279","QuestionID":"QID279"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID28","SecondaryAttribute":"Gender","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"color:#000000;\">Please tell us what gender you identify as&nbsp;<\/span>","DataExportTag":"GenderMFO","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"QuestionDescription":"Gender","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Male"},"2":{"Display":"Female"},"3":{"Display":"Other","TextEntry":"true"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"Re