:#000000;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ccf77ae3-7fff-7ca9-c651-6c936e4516e2\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">This refers to any relationship in which one individual sells something and another individual buys that thing, and they interact with each other directly.<b> <\/b>This may include an online vendor selling to an online customer.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p><div>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Now consider a good relationship between a customer and seller. \u00a0 This refers to any relationship...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ede057b0-7fff-1820-d47c-1534a66d3d78\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Now consider an ideal relationship between<strong> teammates.&nbsp;<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><br><\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-fe1c46a4-7fff-b022-36ca-0b0d2c304a5e\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">This refers to a relationship between two people who are in a clearly defined group together working towards a common goal. It includes teammates on a sports team or members of a theater troupe, for example.<\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<div>\n<p><span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">For each of the functions below, please move the slider to show how much you think this kind of relationship <strong>IDEALLY<\/strong> serves that function. <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Q291","QuestionID":"QID291"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID292","SecondaryAttribute":"I.Customer.Care","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">To what extent would a <u>good<\/u> relationship between a customer and seller typically serve the function of <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">giving or receiving support based on need, without creating a debt<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">? (Care function.)<\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel",