stionText_Unsafe":"<div><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: normal;\">To what extent does the relationship between teammates <u>ideally<\/u> serve the function of<\/span><\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> forming and maintaining a group identity to meet the needs of the group as a whole. (<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Coalition <\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">function.)<\/span><\/div>","DataExportTag":"I.Neighbor.Coal","QuestionID":"QID302"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID303","SecondaryAttribute":"Now consider a good relationship between \"friends with benefits.\"\u00a0That is, consider the best rela..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ede057b0-7fff-1820-d47c-1534a66d3d78\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Now consider a <u>good<\/u> relationship between<strong> &quot;friends with benefits.&quot;&nbsp;<\/strong><\/span><\/span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">That is, consider the best relationship that &quot;friends with benefits&quot; could have with one another (in terms of a relationship of that kind).<\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-0a1a91f5-7fff-4bdf-2f3c-3ea3152baffa\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">This refers to people who know each other and interact sexually on a somewhat regular basis, but who refer to each other as friends rather than romantic partners. It includes friends who interact sexually without committing to a monogamous romantic relationship. <\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">For each of the functions below, please move the slider to show how much you think a <u>good<\/u> relationship of this kind would <\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">serve that function. If you think it doesn&#39;t matter or it&#39;s neutral whether the relationship serves that function, please select &quot;0&quot; (you will have to move the slider away and back to do so).<\/span><\/span><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Now consider a good relationship between \"friends with benefits.\"\u00a0That is, consider the best rela...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ede057b0-7fff-1820-d47c-1534a66d3d78\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Now consider an ideal relationship between<strong> teammates.&nbsp;<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><br><\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-fe1c46a4-7fff-b022-36ca-0b0d2c304a5e\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">This refers to a relationship between two people who are in a clearly defined group together working towards a common goal. It includes teammates on a sports team or members of a theater troupe, for example.<\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<div>\n<p><span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">For each of the functions below, please move the slider to show how much you think this kind of relationship <strong>IDEALLY<\/strong> serves that function. <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Q303","QuestionID":"QID303"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID304","SecondaryAttribute":"I.FWB.Care","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">To what extent would a <u>good<\/u> relationship between \"friends with benefits\" typically serve the function of <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">giving or receiving support based on need, without creating a debt<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">? (Care function.)<\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel","CSSliderMin":-100,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":2,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0.5011655011655011815463467428344301879405975341796875},"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"I.FWB.Care","Choices":{"1":{"Display":""}},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":4,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely WOULD NOT"},"2":{"Display":"Neutral"},"3":{"Display":"Definitely WOULD"}},"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Que