sian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> forming and maintaining a group identity to meet the needs of the group as a whole. (<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Coalition <\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">function.)<\/span><\/div>","DataExportTag":"I.AQ.Coal","QuestionID":"QID314"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID315","SecondaryAttribute":"Now consider a good relationship between two members of a political party. That is, consider the...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ede057b0-7fff-1820-d47c-1534a66d3d78\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Now consider a <u>good<\/u> relationship between two<strong> <\/strong><strong>members of a political party. <\/strong><\/span><\/span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">That is, consider the best relationship that two members of the same political party could have with one another (in terms of a relationship of that kind).<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap;\">This refers to people who are active, registered members of the same political party. They likely hold similar ideological positions and tend to vote for the same candidates in elections. They may not necessarily know each other for any other reason than their common political activities and party affiliation. <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<div>\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">For each of the functions below, please move the slider to show how much you think a <u>good<\/u> relationship of this kind would<\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> serve that function. If you think it doesn't matter or it's neutral whether the relationship serves that function, please select \"0\" (you will have to move the slider away and back to do so).<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Now consider a good relationship between two members of a political party. That is, consider the...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ede057b0-7fff-1820-d47c-1534a66d3d78\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Now consider an ideal relationship between<strong> teammates.&nbsp;<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><br><\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-fe1c46a4-7fff-b022-36ca-0b0d2c304a5e\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">This refers to a relationship between two people who are in a clearly defined group together working towards a common goal. It includes teammates on a sports team or members of a theater troupe, for example.<\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<div>\n<p><span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">For each of the functions below, please move the slider to show how much you think this kind of relationship <strong>IDEALLY<\/strong> serves that function. <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Q315","QuestionID":"QID315"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID316","SecondaryAttribute":"I.Polit.Care","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">To what extent would a <u>good<\/u> relationship between two members of the same political party typically serve the function of <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">giving or receiving support based on need, without creating a debt<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">? (Care function.)<\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel","CSSliderMin":-100,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":2,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0.5011655011655011815463467428344301879405975341796875},"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"I.Polit.Care","Choices":{"1":{"Display":""}},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":4,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely WOULD NOT"},"2":{"Display":"Neutral"},"3":{"Display":"Definitely WOULD"}},"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">To what extent does the relationship between teammates <u>ideally<\/u> serve the function of <\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">giving or receiving unconditional support. (<strong>Care<\/strong> function.)<\/span>","DataExportTag":"I.Polit.Care","QuestionID":"QID316"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID317","SecondaryAttribute":"I.Polit.Hierarchy","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); f