lor: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">function.)<\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel","CSSliderMin":-100,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":2,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0.5011655011655011815463467428344301879405975341796875},"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"I.Polit.Recip","Choices":{"1":{"Display":""}},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":4,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely WOULD NOT"},"2":{"Display":"Neutral"},"3":{"Display":"Definitely WOULD"}},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-weight: 700; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: normal;\">To what extent does the relationship between teammates <u>ideally<\/u> serve the function of<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> keeping things fair between people of equal status. (<\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-weight: 700; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Reciprocal <\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">function.)<\/span>","DataExportTag":"I.Polit.Trans","QuestionID":"QID319"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID32","SecondaryAttribute":"Debriefing Statement \u00a0 Thank you for agreeing to participate in this study! This statement is int..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong>Debriefing Statement<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Thank you for agreeing to participate in this study! This statement is intended to help you learn more about research and further explain the study you participated in.<br>\n<br>\nWe are interested in what functions people think different types of relationships should serve --- particularly within the context of artificial intelligence.&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\">We would like to ask that you <strong>not talk <\/strong>about this study with any other potential participants. If other participants hear about the study and later participate, our results will be invalid. We appreciate your participation in our study. If you have any questions or concerns, please&nbsp;contact Dr Brian Earp at brian.earp@philosophy.ox.ac.uk.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Please continue to the next page to receive your payment code.<\/span><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q25","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Debriefing Statement \u00a0 Thank you for agreeing to participate in this study! This statement is int...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID32","PrivateData":false,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID320","SecondaryAttribute":"I.Polit.Coal","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">To what extent would a <u>well-functioning<\/u><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: normal;\"> relationship between <\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: normal;\">members of the same political party<\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: normal;\"> serve the function of<\/span><\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> <span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">forming and maintaining a group identity for a common goal: us versus them<\/span>? (Coalition<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> <\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">function.)<\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel","CSSliderMin":-100,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":2,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0.5011655011655011815463467428344301879405975341796875},"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"I.Polit.Coal","Choices":{"1":{"Display":""}},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":4,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely SHOULD NOT"},"2":{"Display":"Neutral"},"3":{"Display":"Definitely SHOULD"}},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: normal;\">To what extent does the relationship between teammates <u>ideally<\/u> serve the function of<\/span><\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> forming and maintaining a group identity to meet the needs of the group as a whole. (<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Coalition <\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">function.)<\/span><\/div>","DataExportTag":"I.Polit.Coal","QuestionID":"QID320"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID321","SecondaryAttribute":"Now consider a good relationship between roommates or housemates.\u00a0That is, consider the best rela..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ede057b0-7fff-1820-d47c-1534a66d3d78\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Now consider a <u>good<\/u> relationship between<strong> roommates or housemates.&nbsp;<\/strong><\/span><\/span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">That is, consider the best relationship that roommates or housemates could have with one another (in terms of a relationship of that kind).<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">This refers to relationships between people who live together and are not family members or in a romantic relationship. This includes college room- or suite mates, apartment mates, or housemates, for example.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">For each of the functions below, please move the slider to show how much you think a <u>good<\/u> relationship of this kind would<\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> serve that function. If you think it doesn&#39;t matter or it&#39;s neutral whether the relationship serves that function, please select &quot;0&quot; (you will have to move the slider away and back to do so).<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Now consider a good relationship between roommates or housemates.\u00a0That is, consider the best rela...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ede057b0-7fff-1820-d47c-1534a66d3d78\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Now consider an ideal relationship between<strong> teammates.&nbsp;<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><br><\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-fe1c46a4-7fff-b022-36ca-0b0d2c304a5e\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">This refers to a relationship between two people who are in a clearly defined group together working towards a common goal. It includes teammates on a sports team or members of a theater troupe, for example.<\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<div>\n<p><span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">For each of the functions below, please move the slider to show how much you think this kind of relationship <strong>IDEALLY<\/strong> serves that function. <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Q321","QuestionID":"QID321"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID322","SecondaryAttribute":"I.RoomHous.Care","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">To what extent would a <u>good<\/u> relationship between roommates or housemates typically serve the function of <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">giving or receiving support based on need, without creating a debt<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">? (Care function.)<\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel","CSSliderMin":-100,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":2,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0.5011655011655011815463467428344301879405975341796875},"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"I.RoomHous.Care","Choices":{"1":{"Display":""}},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":4,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely WOULD NOT"},"2":{"Display":"Neutral"},"3":{"Display":"Definitely WOULD"}},"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">To what extent does the relationship between teammates <u>ideally<\/u> serve the function of <\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">giving or receiving unconditional support. (<strong>Care<\/strong> function.)<\/span>","DataExportTag":"I.RoomHous.Care","QuestionID":"QID322"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID323","SecondaryAttribute":"I.RoomHous.Hierarchy","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">To what extent would a <u>good<\/u> relationship between roommates or housemates typically <\/span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">serve the function of <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">coordinating behavior between people with unequal authority over one another<\/span><\/span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">? (Hierarchy function.)<\/span><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel","CSSliderMin":-100,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":2,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0.5011655011655011815463467428344301879405975341796875},"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"I.RoomHous.Hierarchy","Choices":{"1":{"Display":""}},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":4,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely WOULD NOT"},"2":{"Display":"Neutral"},"3":{"Display":"Definitely WOULD"}},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">To what extent does the relationship between teammates <u>ideally<\/u> serve the fu