rrectly. Please match each relationship function with its a...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Establishing\/maintaining a sexual\/romantic relationship"},"2":{"Display":"Balancing benefits: keeping track of who owes what to whom"},"3":{"Display":"Coordinating between individuals with unequal authority"},"4":{"Display":"Giving\/receiving support based on need\/ability, without creating a debt"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"GroupChoiceRange","MinChoices":"1","MaxChoices":"1"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":6,"Groups":["Care","Mating","Hierarchy","Transaction"],"NumberOfGroups":4,"QuestionID":"QID696","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID236\/SelectableChoice\/Group\/1\/1","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Please match each relationship function (on the left) with its appropriate label (in the boxes),...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Establishing\/maintaining a sexual\/romantic relationship - Mating<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID236\/SelectableChoice\/Group\/1\/1","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"NotSelected","QuestionID":"QID236","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID236","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"1":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID236\/SelectableChoice\/Group\/2\/3","Conjuction":"Or","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Please match each relationship function (on the left) with its appropriate label (in the boxes),...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Balancing benefits: keeping track of who owes what to whom - Transaction<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID236\/SelectableChoice\/Group\/2\/3","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"NotSelected","QuestionID":"QID236","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID236","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"2":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID236\/SelectableChoice\/Group\/3\/2","Conjuction":"Or","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Please match each relationship function (on the left) with its appropriate label (in the boxes),...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Coordinating between individuals with unequal authority - Hierarchy<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID236\/SelectableChoice\/Group\/3\/2","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"NotSelected","QuestionID":"QID236","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID236","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"3":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID236\/SelectableChoice\/Group\/4\/0","Conjuction":"Or","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Please match each relationship function (on the left) with its appropriate label (in the boxes),...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Giving\/receiving support based on need\/ability, without creating a debt - Care<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID236\/SelectableChoice\/Group\/4\/0","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"NotSelected","QuestionID":"QID236","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID236","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID701","SecondaryAttribute":"Now consider a good relationship between strangers. That is, consider the best relationship that...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ede057b0-7fff-1820-d47c-1534a66d3d78\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Now consider a <u>good<\/u> relationship between<strong> strangers. <\/strong>That is, consider the best relationship that strangers could have with one another (in terms of a relationship of that kind).<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-91dadd63-7fff-0923-d998-fb39b054dd57\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">This refers to people<\/span><\/span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> who encounter each other in any setting for the first time. It includes people <\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> don&rsquo;t know who each other from another context and don&#39;t anticipate interacting again in the future.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<div>\n<p><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">For each of the functions below, please move the slider to show how much you think a <u>good<\/u> relationship of this kind would <\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">serve that function. If you think it doesn&#39;t matter or it&#39;s neutral whether the relationship serves that function, please select &quot;0&quot; (you will have to move the slider away and back to do so).<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Now consider a good relationship between strangers. That is, consider the best relationship that...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ede057b0-7fff-1820-d47c-1534a66d3d78\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Now consider an ideal relationship between<strong> members of the same political party.&nbsp;<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-91dadd63-7fff-0923-d998-fb39b054dd57\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">This refers to people who have not encountered one another in the past, don\u2019t know who each other, and don't anticipate interacting again in the future. It includes people that encounter each other in any setting for the first time. <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<div>\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">For each of the functions below, please move the slider to show how much you think this kind of relationship <strong>IDEALLY<\/strong> serves that function. <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Q701","QuestionID":"QID701"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID702","SecondaryAttribute":"I.Stranger.Care","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">To what extent would a <u>good<\/u> relationship between strangers typically serve the function of <\/span><span sty