ryAttribute":"Political.Social","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"How do you identify politically when it comes to <b>social<\/b> issues?&nbsp;","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel","CSSliderMin":0,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":10,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":true,"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0.497461928934010144676136633279384113848209381103515625}},"QuestionDescription":"Political.Social","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\">Choice 1<\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Extremely Conservative"},"2":{"Display":"Extremely Liberal\/Progressive"}},"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":2,"NextAnswerId":3,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"How do you identify politically when it comes to social issues?&nbsp;","DataExportTag":"Political - Social","QuestionID":"QID732"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID733","SecondaryAttribute":"Political.Economic","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"How do you identify politically when it comes to <b>economic<\/b> issues?&nbsp;","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel","CSSliderMin":0,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":10,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":true,"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0.5011655011655011815463467428344301879405975341796875}},"QuestionDescription":"Political.Economic","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\">Choice 1<\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Extremely Conservative"},"2":{"Display":"Extremely Liberal\/Progressive"}},"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":2,"NextAnswerId":3,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"How do you identify politically when it comes to economic issues?&nbsp;","DataExportTag":"Political - Economic","QuestionID":"QID733"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID734","SecondaryAttribute":"Bot.check.Friday","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"To make sure you are a human, please just type in, <u>in all capital letters<\/u>, the name of the day of the week that comes after Thursday and before Saturday (this should be a one-word answer written in all capital letters--the name of a day of the week). This isn't a trick question; it really is just to make sure you are a human and not a robot.&nbsp;","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"SL","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel","AllowFreeResponse":"false"},"QuestionDescription":"Bot.check.Friday","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"To make sure you are a human, please just type in the day of the week that comes after Tuesday and before Thursday. &nbsp;","DataExportTag":"Bot.check.Friday","QuestionID":"QID734","SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID735","SecondaryAttribute":"You are now almost done with this survey. Please answer this last handful of questions about your...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"color:#000000;\">You are now almost done with this survey. Please answer this last handful of questions about yourself.&nbsp;<\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q310","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"You are now almost done with this survey. Please answer this last handful of questions about your...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID735","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID743","SecondaryAttribute":"Please read the following description carefully.\u00a0 \u00a0 Care function. This function coordinates beha.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Please read the following description carefully.&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:black\">Care<\/span><\/strong><span style=\"color:black\"> function. This function coordinates behavior to ensure that an individual's&nbsp;<u>overall well-being<\/u> is secure, without any strings attached to the giving or receiving of help (like expecting direct compensation or favors in return, or feeling an explicit debt). In other words, it ensures that an individual has someone in their corner they can truly count on for aid and support, in good times and bad.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">When relationships serve this function, the individuals pay attention to the genuine <\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">needs<\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> of the other, and strive to ensure that those needs are met <\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration-line: underline; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">to the best of their respective abilities<\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">.<\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">When needs and abilities are <\/span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:underline;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">equal<\/span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">, the individuals may take turns helping each other, or otherwise share burdens equally.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#404040;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-2867d5e8-7fff-3ba3-1947-2f6c76ee77ac\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">When needs and\/or abilities are <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; text-decoration-line: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">unequal<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">, one individual may have to do <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; text-decoration-line: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">more<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> to help the other, but this does not create a specific debt to be repaid. <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Please read the following description carefully.\u00a0 \u00a0 Care function. This function coordinates beha...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>Please read the following description carefully.&nbsp;<\/p><p><br><\/p>\n\n<p><strong>Care<\/strong> function. The main purpose of this kind of relationship is to make sure that a person\u2019s basic well-being is truly taken care of, without any strings attached. In other words, they have someone in their corner that they can count on, in good times and bad. Someone with whom they share a deep bond. In today's world, this would be the sort of person you could list as one of your 'emergency contacts' in your phone. Note that there are two roles assumed by this relationship: the caregiving role (the person that can be counted on), and the care-seeking role (the person who may need unconditional support). Often, both roles can exist in one person in relation to others, with the appropriate role being 'activated' at different times as called for by the situation.<\/p>","DataExportTag":"Q743","QuestionID":"QID743"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID744","SecondaryAttribute":"The purpose of the care function is...\u00a0","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">The purpose of the care function is...&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/span>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"The purpose of the care function is...\u00a0","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">To make sure individuals get everything they want or desire, no matter what<\/span><\/span><\/span>"},"2":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">To secure each other&#39;s well-being, without an expectation of direct compensation<\/span><\/span><\/span>"},"3":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">To ensure there is a leader and a follower when making decisions<\/span><\/span><\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"The purpose of the care function is ...&nbsp;","DataExportTag":"CareQuiz1","QuestionID":"QID744"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID745","SecondaryAttribute":"Care.2nd.Strike","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000;\">That was not the correct answer.&nbsp;<\/span><\/span>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Please read the description again and choose the appropriate response. &nbsp;&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:black\">Care<\/span><\/strong><span style=\"color:black\"> function. This function coordinates behavior to ensure that an individual&#39;s&nbsp;<u>overall well-being<\/u> is secure, without any strings attached to the giving or receiving of help (like expecting direct compensation or favors in return, or feeling an explicit debt). In other words, it ensures that an individual has someone in their corner they can truly count on for aid and support, in good times and bad.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">When relationships serve this function, the individuals pay attention to the genuine <\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">needs<\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> of the other, and strive to ensure that those needs are met <\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration-line: underline; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">to the best of their respective abilities<\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">.<\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">When needs and abilities are <\/span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:underline;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">equal<\/span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">, the individuals may take turns helping each other, or otherwise share burdens equally.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#404040;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-2867d5e8-7fff-3ba3-1947-2f6c76ee77ac\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">When needs and\/or abilities are <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; text-decoration-line: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">unequal<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">, one individual may have to do <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; text-decoration-line: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">more<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> to help the other, but this does not create a specific debt to be repaid. <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">The purpose of the care function is...<\/span><\/div>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"QuestionDescription":"Care.2nd.Strike","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">To make sure individuals get everything they want or desire, no matter what<\/span>"},"2":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">To secure each other&#39;s well-being, without an expectation of direct compensation<\/span>"},"3":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">To ensure there is a leader and a follower when making decisions<\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID744\/SelectableChoice\/2","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">The purpose of the care function is...&nbsp;<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#000000;\"&gt;To secure each other&amp;#39;s well-being, without an expectation of direct compensation&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID744\/SelectableChoice\/2","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"NotSelected","QuestionID":"QID744","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID744","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"color:#FF0000;\">That was not the correct answer.&nbsp;<\/span>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>Please read the description again and choose the appropriate response. &nbsp;&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><strong>Care<\/strong> function. The main purpose of this kind of relationship is to make sure that a person\u2019s basic well-being is truly taken care of, without any strings attached. In other words, they have someone in their corner that they can count on, in good times and bad. Someone with whom they share a deep bond. In today's world, this would be the sort of person you could list as one of your 'emergency contacts' in your phone. Note that there are two roles assumed by this relationship: the caregiving role (the person that can be counted on), and the care-seeking role (the person who may need unconditional support). Often, both roles can exist in one person in relation to others, with the appropriate role being 'activated' at different times as called for by the situation.&nbsp; The purpose of the care function is...<\/div>","DataExportTag":"CareQuiz2","QuestionID":"QID745"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID746","SecondaryAttribute":"That was not the correct answer.\u00a0 \u00a0 You will now be taken to the end of this survey.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">That was not the correct answer.&nbsp;<\/span><\/span>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">You will now be taken to the end of this survey.<\/span><\/div>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"That was not the correct answer.\u00a0 \u00a0 You will now be taken to the end of this survey.","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">I understand.<\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID745\/SelectableChoice\/1","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Care.2nd.Strike<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;To make sure individuals get everything they want or desire, no matter what&lt;\/span&gt;<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID745\/SelectableChoice\/1","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID745","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID745","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"1":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID745\/SelectableChoice\/3","Conjuction":"Or","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Care.2nd.Strike<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;To ensure there is a leader and a follower when making decisions&lt;\/span&gt;<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID745\/SelectableChoice\/3","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID745","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID745","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">That was not the correct answer.&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><\/span><div>&nbsp;<\/div><div>You will now be taken to the end of this survey.<\/div>","DataExportTag":"CareQuizStrikeOut","QuestionID":"QID746","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID821","SecondaryAttribute":"Please read the following description carefully.\u00a0 \u00a0 Transaction function. This function coordinat.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Please read the following description carefully.&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:black\">Transaction<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:black\"> function. This function coordinates behavior in situations where individuals do <u>not<\/u> have a special responsibility for helping each other unconditionally, but when they can still mutually benefit through cooperation or exchange.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:black\">When relationships serve this function, each individual asks \"What's in it for me?\" Accordingly, each individual pays close attention to <strong>who has contributed what<\/strong> to a joint activity or agreement, and strives to ensure that the respective benefits are <u>proportional<\/u> to what each has contributed.<br>\n<br>\n\"You get back what you put in\" -- or \"you get what you paid for\" -- is the logic of this function.<br>\n<br>\nWhen contributions or claims on a benefit are <u>equal<\/u>, the fairest solution will be to share equally, take turns enjoying the benefit, or trade comparable benefits with one another. In any case, it's important to keep track of <u>who owes what to whom<\/u>, so the scales don't get out of balance.<\/span><\/span><\/span>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Please read the following description carefully.\u00a0 \u00a0 Transaction function. This function coordinat...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>Please read the following description carefully.<\/p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<p><strong>Reciprocity&nbsp;<\/strong>function. The main purpose of this kind of relationship is to coordinate behavior between people who can mutually benefit, allowing them to exchange goods and services in a fair manner. So this can be a kind of \u2018tit-for-tat\u2019 arrangement between people in a given situation, where each one says, \u201cI'll scratch your back if you scratch mine.\u201d It usually involves keeping track of who has gotten what benefits, and who has accepted what costs, and then trying to make sure that the scales don't get out of balance.<\/p>","DataExportTag":"Q821","QuestionID":"QID821"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID822","SecondaryAttribute":"The purpose of the transaction function is...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">The purpose of the transaction function is...<\/span><\/span><\/span>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"The purpose of the transaction function is...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">To coordinate behavior for mutual benefit through keeping track of who owes what to whom<\/span><\/span><\/span>"},"4":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">To make sure that individuals give unconditional support to others, no matter what<\/span><\/span><\/span>"},"5":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">To make sure that individuals of unequal authority coordinate effectively<\/span><\/span><\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">The purpose of the reciprocity function is...<\/span>","DataExportTag":"TransQuiz1","QuestionID":"QID822"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID823","SecondaryAttribute":"Recip.2nd.Strike","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">That was not the correct answer.&nbsp;<\/span><\/span>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"> Please read the description again and choose the appropriate response.<\/span><br \/>\n&nbsp;\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Please read the following description carefully.&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:black\">Transaction<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:black\"> function. This function coordinates behavior in situations where individuals do <u>not<\/u> have a special responsibility for helping each other unconditionally, but when they can still mutually benefit through cooperation or exchange.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<br \/>\n<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:black\">When relationships serve this function, each individual asks &quot;What&#39;s in it for me?&quot; Accordingly, each individual pays close attention to <strong>who has contributed what<\/strong> to a joint activity or agreement, and strives to ensure that the respective benefits are <u>proportional<\/u> to what each has contributed.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n&quot;You get back what you put in&quot; -- or &quot;you get what you paid for&quot; -- is the logic of this function.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nWhen contributions or claims on a benefit are <u>equal<\/u>, the fairest solution will be to share equally, take turns enjoying the benefit, or trade comparable benefits with one another. In any case, it&#39;s important to keep track of <u>who owes what to whom<\/u>, so the scales don&#39;t get out of balance.<\/span><\/span><\/span>\n\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">The purpose of the transaction function is...<\/span><\/span><\/div>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"QuestionDescription":"Recip.2nd.Strike","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">To coordinate behavior for mutual benefit through keeping track of who owes what to whom"},"2":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">To make sure that individuals give unconditional support to others, no matter what<\/span>"},"3":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">To make sure that individuals of unequal authority coordinate effectively<\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID822\/SelectableChoice\/1","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">The purpose of the transaction function is...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">&lt;span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#000000;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;To coordinate behavior for mutual benefit through keeping track of who owes what to whom&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID822\/SelectableChoice\/1","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"NotSelected","QuestionID":"QID822","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID822","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">That was not the correct answer.&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><\/span><div>&nbsp;<\/div>Please read the description again and choose the appropriate response. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><strong>Reciprocity<\/strong>&nbsp;function. The main purpose of this kind of relationship is to coordinate behavior between people who can mutually benefit, allowing them to exchange goods and services in a fair manner. So this can be a kind of \u2018tit-for-tat\u2019 arrangement between people in a given situation, where each one says, \u201cI'll scratch your back if you scratch mine.\u201d It usually involves keeping track of who has gotten what benefits, and who has accepted what costs, and then trying to make sure that the scales don't get out of balance. &nbsp;<br>\n<br>\nThe purpose of the reciprocity function is...<\/div>","DataExportTag":"TransQuiz2","QuestionID":"QID823"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID824","SecondaryAttribute":"That was not the correct answer.\u00a0 \u00a0 You will now be taken to the end of this survey.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">That was not the correct answer.&nbsp;<\/span><\/span>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">You will now be taken to the end of this survey.<\/span><\/div>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"That was not the correct answer.\u00a0 \u00a0 You will now be taken to the end of this survey.","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">I understand.<\/span>"}},"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID823\/SelectableChoice\/2","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Recip.2nd.Strike<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;To make sure that individuals give unconditional support to others, no matter what&lt;\/span&gt;<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID823\/SelectableChoice\/2","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID823","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID823","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"1":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID823\/SelectableChoice\/3","Conjuction":"Or","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Recip.2nd.Strike<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;To make sure that individuals of unequal authority coordinate effectively&lt;\/span&gt;<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID823\/SelectableChoice\/3","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID823","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID823","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">That was not the correct answer.&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><\/span><div>&nbsp;<\/div><div>You will now be taken to the end of this survey.<\/div>","DataExportTag":"TransStrikeOut","QuestionID":"QID824","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID847","SecondaryAttribute":"Please read the following description carefully. \u00a0 Coalition function. The main purpose of this k..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Please read the following description carefully.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Coalition<\/strong> function. The main purpose of this kind of relationship is to form and maintain a group identity, so group members can work toward a common goal. People in the same group look out for each other and try to promote their own group's interests over the interests of competing groups: \u201cus versus them.\u201d&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/span>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">This involves having shared expectations for what's normal or appropriate behavior and potentially making sacrifices for the good of the group, especially when it's in danger.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Please read the following description carefully. \u00a0 Coalition function. The main purpose of this k...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>Please read the following description carefully.<\/p>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n<strong>Coalition<\/strong> function. The main purpose of this kind of relationship is to form and maintain a group identity, so group members can work toward a common goal. People in the same group look out for each other and try to promote their own group's interests over the interests of competing groups: \u201cus versus them.\u201d This involves having shared expectations for what's normal or appropriate behavior and potentially making sacrifices for the good of the group, especially when it's in danger.","DataExportTag":"Q847","QuestionID":"QID847"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID848","SecondaryAttribute":"The purpose of the coalition function is...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">The purpose of the coalition function is...<\/span><\/span><\/span>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"The purpose of the coalition function is...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">To make sure that a group of people can work effectively toward a common goal<\/span><\/span>"},"4":{"Display":"<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">To make sure that a group of people acquires as much territory as possible<\/span><\/span>"},"5":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">To make sure that individual people preserve their individuality<\/span><\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">The purpose of the coalition function is...<\/span>","DataExportTag":"Q848","QuestionID":"QID848"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID849","SecondaryAttribute":"Coal.2nd.Strike","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">That was not the correct answer.&nbsp;<\/span><\/span>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"> <span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Please read the description again and choose the appropriate response.<\/span><\/span>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Coalition<\/span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;function. The main purpose of this kind of relationship is to form and maintain a group identity, so group members can work toward a common goal. People in the same group look out for each other and try to promote their own group's interests over the interests of competing groups: \u201cus versus them.\u201d&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br><\/span><\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">This involves having shared expectations for what's normal or appropriate behavior and potentially making sacrifices for the good of the group, especially when it's in danger.<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">The purpose of the coalition function is...<\/span><\/div>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"QuestionDescription":"Coal.2nd.Strike","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"To make sure that a group of people can work effectively toward a common goal"},"2":{"Display":"To make sure that a group of people acquires as much territory as possible"},"3":{"Display":"To make sure that individual people preserve their individuality"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"LogicType":"Question","QuestionID":"QID848","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID848\/SelectableChoice\/1","Operator":"NotSelected","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID848","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID848\/SelectableChoice\/1","Type":"Expression","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">The purpose of the coalition function is...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">&lt;span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#000000;\"&gt;To make sure that a group of people can work effectively toward a common goal&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Selected<\/span> "},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">That was not the correct answer.&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><\/span><div>&nbsp;<\/div><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Please read the description again and choose the appropriate response.<\/span><br><div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Coalition<\/span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;function. The main purpose of this kind of relationship is to form and maintain a group identity, so group members can work toward a common goal. People in the same group look out for each other and try to promote their own group's interests over the interests of competing groups: \u201cus versus them.\u201d This involves having shared expectations for what's normal or appropriate behavior and potentially making sacrifices for the good of the group, especially when it's in danger.<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>The purpose of the coalition function is...<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Q849","QuestionID":"QID849"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID850","SecondaryAttribute":"That was not the correct answer.\u00a0 \u00a0 You will now be taken to the end of this survey.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">That was not the correct answer.&nbsp;<\/span><\/span>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">You will now be taken to the end of this survey.<\/span><\/div>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"That was not the correct answer.\u00a0 \u00a0 You will now be taken to the end of this survey.","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">I understand.<\/span>"}},"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"LogicType":"Question","QuestionID":"QID849","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID849\/SelectableChoice\/2","Operator":"Selected","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID849","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID849\/SelectableChoice\/2","Type":"Expression","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Coal.2nd.Strike<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">To make sure that a group of people acquires as much territory as possible<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> "},"1":{"LogicType":"Question","QuestionID":"QID849","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID849\/SelectableChoice\/3","Operator":"Selected","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID849","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID849\/SelectableChoice\/3","Type":"Expression","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Coal.2nd.Strike<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">To make sure that individual people preserve their individuality<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","Conjuction":"Or"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">That was not the correct answer.&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><\/span><div>&nbsp;<\/div><div>You will now be taken to the end of this survey.<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Q850","QuestionID":"QID850","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID856","SecondaryAttribute":"Please read the following description carefully. Hierarchy function. This function coordinates be...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Please read the following description carefully.<br>\n<br>\n<strong>Hierarchy<\/strong> function. This function coordinates behavior in situations where individuals have <u>different<\/u> authority over -- and hence different responsibility for -- one another. In many situations, it is most effective for one individual to be in charge or have final say about what happens. So the hierarchy function involves assigning individuals roles based on their respective authority and responsibility in a given situation, in order to coordinate behavior in a more efficient manner and help accomplish goals.<br>\n<br>\nWhen relationships serve the hierarchy function, there are two main roles: the individual who is ultimately in charge (or who has more say about what happens) and the individual who is not in charge (or who has less say about what happens).<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Please read the following description carefully. Hierarchy function. This function coordinates be...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>Please read the following description carefully.<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><strong>Hierarchy<\/strong> function. The main purpose of this kind of relationship is to help coordinate behavior between people with different statuses (often they have unequal power or responsibility). In many situations, it is most effective for one person to be the 'leader' or have final say about what happens. So hierarchical relationships involve assigning people to different roles based on their status or power in a given situation, to help coordinate behavior and accomplish goals. There are two main roles in such relationships: the leader role and the follower role. The person in the leader role has 'final say' over what happens, while the person in the follower role ultimately must go along with what the leader decides.<\/p>","DataExportTag":"Q856","QuestionID":"QID856"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID857","SecondaryAttribute":"The purpose of the hierarchy function is...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">The purpose of the hierarchy function is...<\/span><\/span><\/span>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"The purpose of the hierarchy function is...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">To make sure that individuals of different authority can work effectively together<\/span><\/span><\/span>"},"4":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">To make sure that individuals of equal authority can work effectively together<\/span><\/span><\/span>"},"5":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">To track contributions and keep things fair<\/span><\/span><\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"The purpose of the hierarchy function is...","DataExportTag":"HierQuiz1","QuestionID":"QID857"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID858","SecondaryAttribute":"Hiearchy.2nd.Strike","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">That was not the correct answer.&nbsp;<\/span><\/span>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Please read the description again and choose the appropriate response.&nbsp;<\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Hierarchy<\/strong> function. This function coordinates behavior in situations where individuals have <u>different<\/u> authority over -- and hence different responsibility for -- one another. In many situations, it is most effective for one individual to be in charge or have final say about what happens. So the hierarchy function involves assigning individuals roles based on their respective authority and responsibility in a given situation, in order to coordinate behavior in a more efficient manner and help accomplish goals.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nWhen relationships serve the hierarchy function, there are two main roles: the individual who is ultimately in charge (or who has more say about what happens) and the individual who is not in charge (or who has less say about what happens).<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">The purpose of the hierarchy function is...<\/span><\/span><\/div>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"QuestionDescription":"Hiearchy.2nd.Strike","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">To make sure that individuals of different authority can work effectively together<\/span><\/span><\/span>"},"2":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">To make sure that individuals of equal authority can work effectively together<\/span><\/span><\/span>"},"3":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">To track contributions and keep things fair<\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">That was not the correct answer.&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><\/span><div>&nbsp;<\/div><div>Please read the description again and choose the appropriate response. &nbsp;&nbsp;<\/div><div><p>&nbsp;<\/p><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Hierarchy<\/span>&nbsp;function. The main purpose of this kind of relationship is to help coordinate behavior between people with different statuses (often they have unequal power or responsibility). In many situations, it is most effective for one person to be the 'leader' or have final say about what happens. So hierarchical relationships involve assigning people to different roles based on their status or power in a given situation, to help coordinate behavior and accomplish goals. There are two main roles in such relationships: the leader role and the follower role. The person in the leader role has 'final say' over what happens, while the person in the follower role ultimately must go along with what the leader decides.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>The purpose of the hierarchy function is...<\/div>","DataExportTag":"HierQuiz2","QuestionID":"QID858","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID857\/SelectableChoice\/1","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">The purpose of the hierarchy function is...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#000000;\"&gt;To make sure that individuals of different authority can work effectively together&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID857\/SelectableChoice\/1","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"NotSelected","QuestionID":"QID857","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID857","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID859","SecondaryAttribute":"That was not the correct answer.\u00a0 \u00a0 You will now be taken to the end of this survey.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">That was not the correct answer.&nbsp;<\/span><\/span>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">You will now be taken to the end of this survey.<\/span><\/div>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"That was not the correct answer.\u00a0 \u00a0 You will now be taken to the end of this survey.","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">I understand.<\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID858\/SelectableChoice\/2","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Hiearchy.2nd.Strike<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#000000;\"&gt;To make sure that individuals of equal authority can work effectively together&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID858\/SelectableChoice\/2","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID858","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID858","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"1":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID858\/SelectableChoice\/3","Conjuction":"Or","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Hiearchy.2nd.Strike<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;To track contributions and keep things fair&lt;\/span&gt;<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID858\/SelectableChoice\/3","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID858","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID858","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">That was not the correct answer.&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><\/span><div>&nbsp;<\/div><div>You will now be taken to the end of this survey.<\/div>","DataExportTag":"HierStrikeOut","QuestionID":"QID859","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID872","SecondaryAttribute":"Please read the following description carefully.Mating function. The main purpose of this kind of","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Please read the following description carefully.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-5822c2e9-7fff-ce13-67d9-54e64c2d6ec7\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Mating<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> function. This function coordinates behavior to allow individuals to <u>find and maintain a sexual or romantic partner<\/u>. For our ancestors, the ultimate point of mating was to produce healthy offspring, so that we could pass on our genes and continue as a species. <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Of course, today we have birth control, and people often have sexual or romantic relationships without consciously planning to have children. But the underlying \"logic\" of the mating function \u00ad\u00adin terms of the feelings and motivations it tends to inspire remains the same: to attract and secure an intimate partner.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"QuestionDescription":"Please read the following description carefully.Mating function. The main purpose of this kind of","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>Please read the following description carefully.<\/p><p><br><\/p>\n\n<p><strong>Mating<\/strong> function. The main purpose of this kind of relationship is to find and maintain a sexual partner. For our ancestors, the ultimate point of mating was to produce healthy offspring, so that we could pass on our genes and continue as a species. Of course, today we have birth control, and people often have sexual relationships without consciously planning to have children. But the underlying \"logic\" of the mating relationship -- in terms of the feelings and motivations it tends to inspire -- remains the same: to attract and secure a mate and stay with that person long enough to at least potentially have children together. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>","DataExportTag":"Q872","QuestionID":"QID872"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID873","SecondaryAttribute":"The purpose of the mating function is...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">The purpose of the mating function is...<\/span><\/span><\/span>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"The purpose of the mating function is...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">To make sure that individuals have strong platonic friendships<\/span><\/span><\/span>"},"4":{"Display":"<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">To make sure that groups stay bonded together<\/span><\/span><\/span>"},"5":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">To make sure that individuals secure a sexual or romantic partner<\/span><\/span><\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">The purpose of the mating relationship is...<\/span>","DataExportTag":"MateQuiz1","QuestionID":"QID873"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID874","SecondaryAttribute":"Mate.2nd.Strike","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">That was not the correct answer.&nbsp;<\/span><\/span>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Please read the description again and choose the appropriate response. &nbsp;&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-5822c2e9-7fff-ce13-67d9-54e64c2d6ec7\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Mating<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> function. This function coordinates behavior to allow individuals to <u>find and maintain a sexual or romantic partner<\/u>. For our ancestors, the ultimate point of mating was to produce healthy offspring, so that we could pass on our genes and continue as a species. <\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Of course, today we have birth control, and people often have sexual or romantic relationships without consciously planning to have children. But the underlying \"logic\" of the mating function \u00ad\u00adin terms of the feelings and motivations it tends to inspire remains the same: to attract and secure an intimate partner.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">The purpose of the mating function is...<\/span><\/span><\/div>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"QuestionDescription":"Mate.2nd.Strike","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">To make sure that individuals have strong platonic friendships<\/span><\/span>"},"2":{"Display":"<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">To make sure that groups stay bonded together<\/span><\/span>"},"3":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">To make sure that individuals secure a sexual or romantic partner<\/span><\/span><\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType"