","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID906","SecondaryAttribute":"Feedback2","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Besides the four relationship functions we presented to you (care, transaction, hierarchy, mating), a<\/span>re there any important relationship functions that you think weren't included?<\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"MissingFunction","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"SL","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel","AllowFreeResponse":"false"},"QuestionDescription":"Feedback2","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID906","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID907","SecondaryAttribute":"Now consider a good relationship between a mother and adult child. That is, consider the best rel...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ede057b0-7fff-1820-d47c-1534a66d3d78\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">Now <\/span>consider a <u>good<\/u> relationship between<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"> <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">a<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"> mother and <u>adult<\/u> child. <\/span><\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">That is, consider the best relationship that a mother and adult child could have with one another (in terms of a relationship of that kind).<\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">This refers to mothers and their adult (meaning <u><strong>over<\/strong><\/u> age 18) children. It includes both biological and adoptive mothers\/children.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">For each of the functions below, please move the slider to show how much you think a <u>good<\/u> relationship of this kind would<\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> serve that function. If you think it doesn&#39;t matter or it&#39;s neutral whether the relationship serves that function, please select &quot;0&quot; (you will have to move the slider away and back to do so).<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Now consider a good relationship between a mother and adult child. That is, consider the best rel...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ede057b0-7fff-1820-d47c-1534a66d3d78\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">Now <\/span>consider an ideal relationship between<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"> <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">a<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"> parent and <u>adult<\/u> child. <\/span><\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">That is, consider the best possible relationship that a parent and adult child could have with one another (in terms of a relationship of that kind).<\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">But this refers to parents and their adult (<u>meaning <strong>over<\/strong> age 18<\/u>) children specifically. It includes both biological and adoptive parents\/children.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">For each of the functions below, please move the slider to show how much you think this kind of relationship <span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">IDEALLY<\/span> serves that function. <\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Q907","QuestionID":"QID907"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID908","SecondaryAttribute":"I.MotherO18.Care","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">To what extent would a <u>good<\/u> relationship between a mother and adult child (over age 18) typically serve the function of <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">giving or receiving support based on need, without creating a debt<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">? (Care function.)<\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel","CSSliderMin":-100,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":2,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0.5011655011655011815463467428344301879405975341796875},"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"I.MotherO18.Care","Choices":{"1":{"Display":""}},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":4,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely WOULD NOT"},"2":{"Display":"Neutral"},"3":{"Display":"Definitely WOULD"}},"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">To what extent should the relationship between a parent and adult child (over age 18) <u>ideally<\/u> serve the function of <\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">giving or receiving unconditional support<\/span>? (Care function.)<\/span>","DataExportTag":"I.MotherO18.Care","QuestionID":"QID908"}},{"SurveyI