0-d47c-1534a66d3d78\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Now consider a <u>good<\/u> relationship between<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"> <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">a<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"> mother and <u>non-adult<\/u> child. <\/span><\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">That is, consider the best relationship that a mother and non-adult child could have with one another (in terms of a relationship of that kind).<\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">This refers to mothers and their non-adult (meaning <strong><u>under<\/u><\/strong> age 18) children. It includes both biological and adoptive mothers\/children.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">For each of the functions below, please move the slider to show how much you think a <u>good<\/u> relationship of this kind would <\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">serve that function. If you think it doesn&#39;t matter or it&#39;s neutral whether the relationship serves that function, please select &quot;0&quot; (you will have to move the slider away and back to do so).<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Now consider a good relationship between a mother and non-adult child. That is, cons