<span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">function.)<\/span><\/div>","DataExportTag":"A. MotherO18.Coal","QuestionID":"QID924"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID925","SecondaryAttribute":"A.MotherOver18.Pre","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Consider the relationship between an <strong>adult<\/strong> <strong>child and mother<\/strong>.&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">In this case, we want you to think of a relationship with your mother, if you have one<\/span><strong>, <\/strong><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">from the period<\/span><strong> <\/strong><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><u>after<\/u> you turned 18. <\/span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Can you think of a person who, together with you, fits that description? <\/span><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"QuestionDescription":"A.MotherOver18.Pre","Choices":{"4":{"Display":"Yes, I can think of someone in the PRESENT"},"5":{"Display":"No, I cannot think of someone in the present, but I can think of someone from a PAST relationship"},"7":{"Display":"No, I cannot think of anyone in the past or present who fits this description"}},"ChoiceOrder":["4","5","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":8,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Consider the relationship between an <strong>adult<\/strong> <strong>child and parent<\/strong>.&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">In this case, we want you to think of a relationship with one of your <b>parents<\/b><\/span><strong>, <\/strong><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">from the period<\/span><strong> <\/strong><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">after you turned 18. <\/span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Can you think of a person who, together with you, fits that description? <\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">If there is someone in the PRESENT, please choose that option (below) and think of such a person. If the <u>only<\/u><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> such relationship you have had is in the past, then please choose that option instead. If there is <u>no one<\/u><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> <\/s