ribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ede057b0-7fff-1820-d47c-1534a66d3d78\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Now consider a <u>good<\/u> relationship between<strong> (NEW) a sex worker and a client. <\/strong>That is, consider the best relationship that a sex worker and client could have with one another (in terms of a relationship of that kind).<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>*Relationship Description*<\/p>\n\n<div>\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">For each of the functions below, please move the slider to show how much you think a <strong><u>good<\/u><\/strong> relationship of this kind would <\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">serve that function. If you think it doesn't matter or it's neutral whether the relationship serves that function, please select \"0\" (you will have to move the slider away and back to do so).<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Now consider a good relationship between (NEW) a sex worker and a client. That is, consider the b...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ede057b0-7fff-1820-d47c-1534a66d3d78\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Now consider a well-functioning relationship between<strong> strangers. <\/strong>That is, consider the best-functioning relationship that strangers could have with one another (in terms of a relationship of that kind).<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-91dadd63-7fff-0923-d998-fb39b054dd57\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">This refers to people<\/span><\/span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> who encounter each other in any setting for the first time. It includes people <\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> don&rsquo;t know who each other from another context and don&#39;t anticipate interacting again in the future.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<div>\n<p><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">For each of the functions below, please move the slider to show how much you think a <strong><u>well-functioning<\/u><\/strong> relationship of this kind would <\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">serve that function. If you think it doesn&#39;t matter or it&#39;s neutral whether the relationship serves that function, please select &quot;0&quot; (you will have to move the slider away and back to do so).<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Q968","QuestionID":"QID968"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8HUAhazmhLBaak6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID969","SecondaryAttribute":"I.Stranger.Care","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-family: Arial; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-variant-lig